(21, NULL, 'One Dog One Bite', 'One Dog One Bite', 'rock', 'THE BAND\r\n\r\nONE DOG ONE BITE\r\n\r\nThis is a one man band and has been performing for over twenty-two years.\r\n\r\nThe band consists of one member namely Chris, on sax and vocals.\r\n\r\nChris plays music professionally and has extensive experience in the corporate as well as the public field.\r\n\r\nMusic is his profession and he plays at formal dinner functions playing background sax music, and performs on vocals and sax at many party functions.\r\n\r\n One Dog One Bite has performed recently with the likes of Dozi and Ray Dylan and at the following venues over the past few years:', '082 657 4200', 'dave@mygigguide.co.za', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'artists/profile_pictures/KyFqFSvPjuuWq63qzHHt02uZVnm7VOj9PQ61a1y7.jpg', NULL, '{\"folder_name\":\"art_1dogonebite_4514\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-05T19:13:30.497332Z\"}', '2025-10-06 02:13:30', '2025-11-01 17:11:32', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'none', NULL, NULL),
