(136, NULL, 'Dan Vee', 'Dan Vee', 'pop', 'Hey! I’m Dan, a popular solo musician based in Johannesburg, South Africa. I play over 150 events per year and love what I do!\r\n\r\nEveryone deserves their dream wedding/event, so I understand that getting the music right is hugely important to you, as it should be.\r\n\r\nMy sound is a mixture of folk pop as well as a huge repertoire of songs in many different genres. I am most commonly known for my covers of popular artists such as Ed Sheeran, Lumineers, George Ezra, Jeremy Loops and similar artists alike.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'artists/profile_pictures/IPMdvONBlbvsvqKtBGc9VmabnX2j73rI36zB7HSZ.png', NULL, '{\"folder_name\":\"art_danvee_9585\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-06T06:31:52.316276Z\"}', '2025-10-06 13:31:52', '2025-10-13 17:50:37', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'none', NULL, NULL),
