(170, NULL, 'Dozi', 'Dozi', 'afrikaans-musiek', 'Dozi, whose real name is Henk Opperman, is a famous South African singer known for his \"sokkie\" music. He was born in 1964, started his professional career in 1999 with the Zulu-gospel album Mercy, and sings in multiple languages like Afrikaans, English, and Zulu. Besides his music career, he also owns a restaurant, has appeared on the TV show Supersterre, and is recognized for his extensive catalogue of work.', NULL, 'louis@musicprofile.co.za', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.facebook.com/Dozifanpage', NULL, 'artists/art_dozi_3677/profile/dozi_1.png', NULL, '{\"folder_name\":\"art_dozi_3677\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-06T06:31:53.011576Z\"}', '2025-10-06 13:31:53', '2025-11-03 12:05:52', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'none', NULL, NULL),
