(446, NULL, 'Sheldon Sham', 'Sheldon Sham', 'pop', 'Sheldon Sham or ``SJ`` as he\'s known to morph into when on the jol, hails from the Vale... Edenvale.\r\nShel is more in love with his instrument (his Saxophone) than any man should be, and has put in the necessary bedroom hours to be considered a master of this fine piece of brass. As you probably already know, he has the ability to melt the face of any man in the audience with his burning brass lines, or weaken the knees of any lass that may find herself in his audiosphere.\r\nOther than being a family-orientated lad, Shel has two modes in life: Sax playing mode, and sleep mode. So after a show we power him down, and store him away until the next one!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'artists/profile_pictures/0Yv8bRnpWHhLl6q9ew12kX8YXhRrkmd5ZbOqRk7d.jpg', NULL, '{\"folder_name\":\"art_sheldonsham_6737\",\"created_at\":\"2025-10-06T06:31:56.679094Z\"}', '2025-10-06 13:31:56', '2025-10-16 21:12:14', 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'none', NULL, NULL),
