(47, 'Jack Atlantic at Hogshead Douglasdale', 'Sundays aren’t the end, they’re the encore! 🎸⚡ Jack Atlantic is at Hogshead Douglasdale this Sunday, bringing live music that keeps the weekend spirit alive. Great food, drink specials, and Jack’s tunes in the mix, it’s the Sunday upgrade you didn’t know you needed.\r\n\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Sunday, 28 September 2025 from 17:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Douglasdale Village Shopping Centre c/o Leslie Avenue & Douglas Drive, Douglasdale', '2025-09-28 00:00:00', '17:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dd_8714/events/event_7087_jack_atlantic_at_hogshead_douglasdale_2025-09-28/poster/EUygvb4yMCHe7sFYbNJOOiunukJmLPPL6Mkuq65p.jpg', NULL, 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 31, 'organiser', 7, '2025-09-27 18:53:50', '2025-09-27 18:53:50'),
(48, '𝗕𝗥𝗨𝗙𝗘𝗦𝗧 2025! Day 1', 'Hogshead Douglasdale is pouring 4 days of big beats, bigger beers, and BruFest-only specials, promos and prizes, from 22–25 October 2025!\r\n\r\n🎤 𝗟𝗜𝗡𝗘-𝗨𝗣\r\n• Wednesday, 22 October: Sheron\r\n• Thursday, 23 October: Anton van Rooyen\r\n• Friday, 24 October: Entourage\r\n• Saturday, 25 October: Jack Atlantic\r\n\r\n✨ 𝗪𝗛𝗔𝗧\'𝗦 𝗢𝗡 𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗕𝗥𝗨𝗙𝗘𝗦𝗧\r\n• Commemorative BruFest 2025 shot glass – only R25 and score 1/3 OFF Brewhogs, Brutal Fruit, Olmeca & More\r\n• Food & Drink Specials all weekend\r\n• Loyalty Members get 4x 500ml beer coupons (1 per day)\r\n• WIN 1 of 4x HB5000 (R5000) jol vouchers – bring past BruFest memorabilia, post a pic at #BruFest2025 & tag your crew!\r\n\r\nCatch the vibe, catch the beers, catch the memories.\r\n\r\n👉 See you at Hogshead Douglasdale for #BruFest2025 🍺', '2025-10-22 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dd_8714/events/event_8005______________________________2025__day_1_2025-10-22/poster/H7XG426MZFk8gucO5lxPdzaSEeTEwz04JVO3HoGk.jpg', NULL, 'upcoming', 'festival', 500, 31, 'organiser', 7, '2025-09-27 19:13:03', '2025-09-27 19:13:03'),
