(56, 'Field Market Day, Parkmore', 'Save the date! 📆 Join us on 𝗦𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗱𝗮𝘆 𝟭𝟭 𝗢𝗰𝘁𝗼𝗯𝗲𝗿 to celebrate all things local. ❤️\r\n\r\nBring your family & friends for a great day out…street food feasting, outdoor shopping, hanging out in the sunshine, listening to live music and all-round good vibes. 🌿☀️😎\r\n\r\nLocal & handmade goods ❤️ // Deli products 🥐🧀🍯🥖// Gourmet Food 🍔🌯🍕🥟 // Craft Drinks 🥂🍻🍹 // Live music 🎶🎵🎶 // Kids play area & activities 🧒 // Pet friendly (well behaved dogs on a leash) 🦮🐶🐕‍🦺// Ample parking 🚘 // Security 🔒\r\n\r\n****************************\r\n⏰ 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲: 9am to 3pm\r\n📅 𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗲: 11 October 2025 - Saturday\r\n📌 𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Field & Study Park, 11 Louise avenue, Parkmore (Sandton)\r\n🎟️ FREE market entry', '2025-10-11 00:00:00', '09:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2575_field_market_day__parkmore_2025-10-11/poster/YW2rvCQhxwYTAFCtx7cfRMPCggsnYSt7v0o2DEe0.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2575_field_market_day__parkmore_2025-10-11\\/gallery\\/UkDtCsJ3qJOCDZjwjR7LNYg59BI5cPwNux5n2yfE.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'festival', NULL, 34, 'organiser', 5, '2025-09-28 14:46:55', '2025-09-28 14:46:55'),
