(116, 'The Hangout: Legends Fest 25 Oct', 'Join us for a special event as we celebrate the legends!\r\nThese bands rocked us right through the 90s and 2000s, and they’ll be rocking us again for one night only, all on one stage at the magnificent Sognage.\r\nThere’ll be loads to eat and drink and loads to be merry about as we sing along to all our favourite classics from all of these massive bands and our musical heroes who are scattered across the world but will be coming together to Hangout and rock out for what will surely be an exceptional evening filled with the best tunes, all kinds of nostalgia and good vibes only this Rocktober.\r\nIt’s going to deliver on every level. This is one party you don’t wanna miss. Grab your tickets, start polishing your docs, and gather your clans.\r\nOn Saturday, 25 October, we hit the dance floor for The Hangout: Legends Fest. Come early. Leave late. Get cabs. Let’s party like it’s 1995!\r\nNo Friends of Harry, Tidal Waves, Henry Ate, Boo!, Squeal, WONDERboom, Paul E Flynn (Sugardrive), and Plum are bringing the fire like they always do.\r\nI’m bringing Karma in from the USA, and Dave de Vetta, all the way from Scotland.\r\nThese magic artists are coming from across the universe for an out-of-this-world experience.\r\nLet’s rock hard.\r\nROAR', '2025-10-25 00:00:00', '14:00:00', 450.00, 'https://tickets.tixsa.co.za/event/the-hangout-legends-fest', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3131_the_hangout__legends_fest_25_oct_2025-10-25/poster/tMeR6rEQN3Rq6j3vCVeROJOJL0PJLiOaEbYKFtnb.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3131_the_hangout__legends_fest_25_oct_2025-10-25\\/gallery\\/JvAIVWa8G5KEKqWpGQn4YojWyKK1zmRF3OiKAYvH.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'festival', NULL, 57, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-09 18:05:01', '2025-10-09 18:06:14'),
(117, 'Jaryd Smith @ Fu-Far 12 Oct', 'Jaryd Smith @ Fu-Bar 12 Oct', '2025-10-12 00:00:00', '12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9835_jaryd_smith___fu_far_12_oct_2025-10-12/poster/vorDaXT4MCHpd96PXHVSGG34Nvnn7yuwbobX15yw.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9835_jaryd_smith___fu_far_12_oct_2025-10-12\\/gallery\\/1wzv4kbH20yoOJbTrrybOFzXoQiz2TDVnmX2dgRe.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'club', NULL, 43, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-09 18:14:15', '2025-10-09 18:14:15'),
(118, 'Lindsay McGuire @ Tigersmilk Bryanston 1 Nov', 'Get ready, Joburg! The ultimate summer kick-off is here — and it\'s going to be BIG, BOLD, and FULL OF VIBES! We\'re turning up the heat with an electrifying line up and a community spirit that celebrates diversity, music, and love.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a proudly LGBTQ+ friendly event – all are welcome, all are celebrated! \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLIVE ACTS:\r\n\r\nKAREN ZOID – South Africa’s rock queen\r\n\r\nLINDSAY MCGUIRE – powerhouse vocals\r\n\r\nHUNTER LEITE – soulful, electric, unforgettable\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n DJs spinning till late:\r\n\r\n DJ LADY LEA\r\n\r\n DJ SKYE\r\n\r\n DJ LESG', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '14:00:00', 300.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/265736-summer-fest-2025/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7774_lindsay_mcguire___tigersmilk_bryanston_1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/2yLOmSxcMQOsJ8i6tx4rPlLVyIWPeMC421eqxPPi.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7774_lindsay_mcguire___tigersmilk_bryanston_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/W7BlKrMYaKMSOTfvLtjeFrbsYc8MTdtOM9n5gQME.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7774_lindsay_mcguire___tigersmilk_bryanston_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/LivnwoPPvxbGX6nq7CECXZR30RI7l3SNk0XkhD0E.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'festival', 1000, 59, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-09 18:25:40', '2025-10-09 18:30:32'),
(119, '30+ Throwdown @ Sognage 7 Nov', 'Holy moly!!! This is gonna be fun! I can’t wait to dj alongside the amazing Shawny B who played so many of the legendary spots back in the 90s and who knows how to rock a dance floor with his eyes closed!!! Kicking off the celebrations is party queen Tamara Dey and she’s bringing her good vibes and her beautiful self to open the night with some 80s tunes. I’m in charge of taking you through the 90s and Shawny will wrap it all up with early 2000s classics. Thanks so much to the superstars at Back To The Beats for having me on this beautiful bill! Tickets at www.webtickets.co.za 💃🥳🥰🩵💛💜🩷 Back to the Beats Parties', '2025-11-07 00:00:00', '19:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7226_30__throwdown___sognage_7_nov_2025-11-07/poster/83rM9kAcJ7yPzsMIGhPw5X9Zk9seywCfB8EaDN2j.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7226_30__throwdown___sognage_7_nov_2025-11-07\\/gallery\\/A98wocyW7421R3CnHI3uFvCaOOM1oCddGdKEsDFJ.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'festival', NULL, 57, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-09 19:02:48', '2025-10-09 19:02:48'),
(121, 'Bok van Blerk @ Hennies Jolly Prawn 11 Oct', '🎶✨ Dis showtime by Hennie’s Jolly Prawn! ✨🎶\r\nBok van Blerk, Jakkie Louw & Joubert kom saam op een verhoog – ’n aand vol groot treffers en groot gees! 🍻🔥\r\nMoenie hierdie mis nie – dit gaan een vir die boeke wees! 📖🎤\r\n📅 Bespreek vandag nog jou tafel – plekke is beperk!\r\n📞 Skakel nou om te bespreek.', '2025-10-11 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9001_bok_van_blerk___hennies_jolly_prawn_11_oct_2025-10-11/poster/AbJVP9dRNCIK996nEhQgOvq3NUCHMEZ4uQAC8eD1.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9001_bok_van_blerk___hennies_jolly_prawn_11_oct_2025-10-11\\/gallery\\/HANnDYnGU0yvtaQMeJMI8hxtA1S8wZi7HPs33edL.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9001_bok_van_blerk___hennies_jolly_prawn_11_oct_2025-10-11\\/gallery\\/Kis3Rs8NU9z1SsW6UuZDekj3PCxZoE5QZQj0gXjt.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 5, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-09 21:57:48', '2025-10-09 21:57:48'),
