(143, 'The Night Bloom @ Garden on Zeiss 7 Nov', '🌸 Vendor Call-Out! | The Night Bloom 🌙\r\n\r\nWe’re gearing up for another magical evening at The Night Bloom — and we’re on the lookout for amazing vendors to join us! 💫\r\n\r\n📍 Venue: Garden on Zeiss, Honeydew, Roodepoort\r\n🕓 Time: 4PM – 10PM\r\n📱 Bookings: WhatsApp 068 724 0929\r\n\r\n✨ We’re looking for:\r\n🍔 Food stalls & street eats\r\n🧁 Desserts & baked goods\r\n☕ Coffee & specialty drinks\r\n🛍️ Handmade crafts & art\r\n💎 Jewelry & accessories\r\n🕯️ Home décor & candles\r\n👕 Clothing & vintage finds\r\n🌿 Plants & eco products\r\n🎨 Face painting, henna & creative artists\r\n🎶 Performers & live acts\r\n\r\nIf you’ve got something unique, local, or creative — we want YOU at The Night Bloom!', '2025-11-07 00:00:00', '16:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5952_the_night_bloom___garden_on_zeiss_7_nov_2025-11-07/poster/RSZERRGFefjw6GjjNztQE7Qz7ZPeQjCRGciezPDD.png', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5952_the_night_bloom___garden_on_zeiss_7_nov_2025-11-07\\/gallery\\/bQgHMcVa2wldDfKbu27GTc1QhlhvxKhdst3EXLmZ.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'festival', NULL, 356, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 15:01:56', '2025-10-11 15:01:56'),
(145, 'Robin Auld @ Radium 26 Oct', 'Lunchtime show with Andrew Clelland on drums and Andrew Joseph on bass, with special guests Bronwyn Krige and Tim Parr. To book call Andy on 083 542 1044', '2025-10-26 00:00:00', '13:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4403_robin_auld___radium_26_oct_2025-10-26/poster/tucRZZdFURJaXfBvGkAn7jfBURFyW1FSAtHlud4d.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4403_robin_auld___radium_26_oct_2025-10-26\\/gallery\\/KAvf1DB4uXv1ZYyGmjXBwYtngQN2Z9xwbb8NQzzU.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 63, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 15:34:27', '2025-10-11 15:34:27'),
