(151, 'Tian Nienaber & Anton Botha @ Railways Irene 16 Oct', 'Tian Nienaber & Anton Botha @ Railways Irene 16 Oct \r\nLineup times:\r\n19:00 24 Strings\r\n20:00 Tian Nienaber\r\n21:00 Anton Botha', '2025-10-16 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 150.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/irene/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8976_tian_nienaber___anton_botha___railways_irene_16_oct_2025-10-16/poster/MgyXPxOKyR7mab7CeJc4hgganPSWA5lj6njYw3BM.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8976_tian_nienaber___anton_botha___railways_irene_16_oct_2025-10-16\\/gallery\\/cO9LPX2MLijJJ9VK1j0cqzLmsUlLnzxQhQfhf19L.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:00:41', '2025-10-11 18:00:41'),
(152, 'Wonderboom @ Railways Irene 24 Oct', 'WONDERboom x BOO! 30 Years of Magic Meets Monkipunk Mayhem!\r\nStarts 6:00 pm Friday 24 October 2025 at Railways Cafe Irene\r\nEnds 11:00 pm\r\nGet ready for an unforgettable night at the legendary Railways Café in Irene a venue as full of soul as the acts it hosts! On 24 October two of South Africa’s most iconic live acts, WONDERboom and BOO!, come together for one explosive gig.\r\n\r\nCelebrating 3 decades of unstoppable energy, WONDERboom continues to defy genre and expectation with their high-octane blend of rock, funk, punk, and afro-dance. Their chemistry on stage is electric - a true brotherhood forged over decades and countless global performances.\r\n\r\nSharing the stage is none other than the genre-bending BOO!, the original purveyors of “monkipunk”. With frontman Chris Chameleon and drummer Riaan van Rensburg leading the charge, BOO! brings their quirky, theatrical energy to Pretoria for one night only.\r\n\r\nWarming up the night is the incredibly talented Sossi, whose fresh sound is the perfect kickoff to a night of musical mastery.\r\n\r\nCome for the legends. Stay for the vibes. Railways Café delivers the perfect setting - drink in hand, music in the air, and good people all around.\r\n\r\nLineup times:\r\n20:00 Sossi\r\n21:00 Boo!\r\n22:00 WONDERboom\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nEarly Bird R100 (limited)\r\nOnline: R150\r\nAt the door: R200 (should the event not sell out online)', '2025-10-25 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 150.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/irene/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4592_wonderboom___railways_irene_24_oct_2025-10-25/poster/N8NjPLCMVklaKhBbIDAVcuY3SjYcJGjTlh1gaPFY.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4592_wonderboom___railways_irene_24_oct_2025-10-25\\/gallery\\/XMdLtbWl3KieLVU996vvfywODMQkCob2TlAs5mM1.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:05:35', '2025-10-11 18:05:35'),
(153, 'Zaan Sonnekus @ Railways Irene 31 Oct', 'If there’s something strange in your neighbourhood this Halloween… you know where to be.\r\n\r\nWho you gonna call for a scary good time? Railways Café, of course – with one monster of a lineup, a venue decorated to its full haunted potential, and prizes for the best dressed.\r\n\r\nWe’re gearing up for a hauntingly good time and a night of music that’ll raise the dead!\r\n\r\nLine Up\r\n5pm - DJ with spooky Beats\r\n8pm Zaan Sonnekus\r\n9pm Taxi Violence\r\n10pm Internet Girl\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nEarly bird R200\r\nPhase 1 R250 (sale ends 15 Oct)\r\nPhase 2 R300\r\nAt the Door R350 (if the evnt is not sold out online)\r\n\r\nRailways Cafe Irene open from 10am\r\n2 Hack Rd, Irene, Centurion\r\n\r\nCard Only venue\r\nGood Vibes Only\r\nNo u/18’s\r\nROAR', '2025-10-31 00:00:00', '17:00:00', 250.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/irene/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2176_zaan_sonnekus___railways_irene_31_oct_2025-10-31/poster/fDNbfQIWS885ofZp0kAfY13Byf5ljnBBdk0gBClg.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2176_zaan_sonnekus___railways_irene_31_oct_2025-10-31\\/gallery\\/qZklbQWuLkgB6RcXLeVULTbQUVmLX6uKOApSYXS2.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:08:48', '2025-10-11 18:08:48'),
(154, 'Roan Ash @ Railways 1 Nov', 'Roan Ash Holy Grounds Tour– Live at Railways Café, Irene\r\n\r\n1 November 2025\r\n\r\nFor the first time ever, Roan Ash brings his celebrated sound to the stage at Railways Café. Known for his rich storytelling, soulful voice, and songs that blend country, folk, and rock, Roan’s debut at this iconic Irene venue is set to be a standout show.\r\n\r\nOpening the night is Dani Villé, a rising talent from the Cape, whose heartfelt performances and unique style have been winning over audiences across the country.\r\n\r\nTwo remarkable artists. One unforgettable evening brought to you by L.A.M.E. Organisers. Don’t miss Roan Ash’s first steps onto the Railways stage.\r\n\r\nGet your tickets now – 1 November.\r\n\r\nLineup times:\r\n18:00 - Doors Open\r\n19:00 - Dani Villé\r\n20:15 - Roan Ash\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nR220 - Early Bird (Limited)\r\nR250 - General\r\nR270 - Door', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 250.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/irene/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5493_roan_ash___railways_1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/uWFzHtOYyekt6dGI7ahFePpWC7SPBbuWGTBsA6C6.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5493_roan_ash___railways_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/606gKyP0mYf13tw3gmzyFJcInMpAbQdsYP6du0Wb.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:11:09', '2025-10-11 18:11:09'),
(155, 'Koos Kombuis @ Railways Irene 14 Nov', 'Join us for an unforgettable evening with the legendary Koos Kombuis at Railways Café Irene. With his unmistakable voice and timeless songs and Railways Cafe\'s cozy theatre. It\'s the perfect setting for an intimate and acoustic performance. Koos Kombuis will take you on a journey through his iconic music and powerful storytelling.\r\n\r\nOpening the show is the talented Crimsun, setting the stage with their unique sound and captivating performance.\r\n\r\nDate: 14 November 2025\r\n\r\nLine up Times\r\n7pm Crimsun\r\n8pm Koos Kombuis\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nR100pp - limited tickets available\r\nR120pp at the door (if not sold out)', '2025-11-14 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 100.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/irene/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2781_koos_kombuis___railways_irene_14_nov_2025-11-14/poster/J1xxNu8QkACAvxkJdvLwgTCgCTHuUeVKo0qjrShq.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2781_koos_kombuis___railways_irene_14_nov_2025-11-14\\/gallery\\/OSopNjzNAf5oQ97sqOe52AI4Ghv1mbFp79DUfeLC.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:13:38', '2025-10-11 18:13:38'),
(156, 'Arno Carstens @ Railways Cafe Cullinan', 'Arno Carstens at Railways Cafe Cullinan\r\nStarts 12:00 pm Sunday 26 October 2025 at Railways Cafe Cullinan\r\nEnds 4:00 pm\r\nA Sunday afternoon you don’t want to miss! Arno Carstens takes the stage at Railways Café Cullinan for a special family-friendly show, bringing his iconic sound to a laid-back setting.\r\n\r\nEnjoy great live music, delicious food, and a relaxed vibe—perfect for the whole family. \r\n\r\nPerformance starts at 1pm\r\nRailways Cafe Cullinan open from 10am\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nR180 online\r\nR200 at the door\r\nLimited tickets available\r\nSeated show & family friendly', '2025-10-26 00:00:00', '12:00:00', 200.00, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/cullinan/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3518_arno_carstens___railways_cafe_cullinan_2025-10-26/poster/RHM1kQ4lmYPHZVXgEuFXrFo7aOHi1z1RoqGbrzBB.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3518_arno_carstens___railways_cafe_cullinan_2025-10-26\\/gallery\\/LJkeutEQCRaSvMS5zfwSFomuEoFrJkEp3fLplDau.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'club', NULL, 358, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-11 18:20:43', '2025-10-11 18:20:43');
