(200, 'ASHTON NYTE & WILL RAYZ + DJ KERRY-ANNE', 'EVENT NAME: ASHTON NYTE & WILL RAYZ + DJ KERRY-ANNE\r\nDATE: Sunday, 30 November 2025\r\nTIME: Doors open at 12:30pm – Show starts at 2pm\r\nBOOKINGS ESSENTIAL!\r\nGENERAL ONLINE + DOOR TICKETS: R200\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Events sell out at short notice – we are unable to accommodate door ticket sales for a sold-out event. Secure your tickets by purchasing them online to avoid disappointment\r\nONLINE BOOKING: https://thetroyeville.co.za/events/ashton-will-kerry/\r\nENQUIRIES:\r\nEMAIL: events@thetroyeville.co.za\r\nWHATSAPP/CALL: 079 612 0125', '2025-10-30 00:00:00', '14:00:00', 200.00, 'https://thetroyeville.co.za/events/ashton-will-kerry/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4695_ashton_nyte___will_rayz___dj_kerry_anne_2025-10-30/poster/p3Usg7uGNPvfEJBo3boekFOPLKgXHxGyB37e61YP.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4695_ashton_nyte___will_rayz___dj_kerry_anne_2025-10-30\\/gallery\\/LUrZCHHFdKGIhXmx128u97l3TKFr65hFgJrETDYn.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 288, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-14 13:27:50', '2025-10-14 13:27:50'),
