(203, 'Jacqueline\'s Experience 80\'s & 90\'s FlashBack 29 Oct', 'JACQUELINE’S 46th ANNIVERSARY \r\n\r\nSaturday, 29 November 2025\r\n\r\nPretoria East — we’re coming for you!\r\n\r\nGet ready for an unforgettable night of glamour, music, and style as we celebrate the Icons of the 80s & 90s.\r\n\r\nDress to Impress and prepare to relive the magic of the decades in true elegance so leave the shorts, sandles & Flip Flops at home. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n?? Whether you Partied in President Arcade OR Wonderboom - We\'re bringing back the magic of the 80s & 90s for The Jacqueline’s Experience 46TH Anniversary –  a one-of-a-kind trip down memory lane! After endless requests from fans wanting to show the next generation how we used to party, we\'re opening the doors ONCE MORE, to those 23 and over (with parents, of course) for this epic night experiencingThe Jacquelines “FAMILY” Experience !\r\n\r\nJoin us on Saturday, 29 NOVEMBER 2025  at PRESLEY’S, Pretoria for a night of non-stop fun, good vibes, and unforgettable tunes with DJ legends  Bigg Dogg, Patch and Solly P. Get ready for a dazzling Light & Laser Show at 8:45 PM, with the doors swinging open at 7:00 PM sharp!\r\n\r\nImportant note: No under-30s allowed,  UNLESS WITH PARENTS. OVER 23 ONLY  (we’re keeping it old-school), and right of admission is reserved. ! ????\r\n\r\nLet’s make this night one for the history books! ??\r\n\r\nVIP TABLES X 10  R250 ppR2500\r\n\r\nincludes entry, meaty snack platter plus Bottle Brandy, Vodka, Gin OR Tequila \r\n\r\nVIP TABLES X 8   @ R250 pp R2000\r\n\r\nincludes entry, meaty snack platter plus 2 Bottles J C le Roux \r\n\r\nTABLES X 4   @ R170 pp R680\r\n\r\nTABLES X 8   @ R170 pp R1360\r\n\r\nGeneral Entry     R150 pp pre sale\r\n\r\nGeneral Entry     R180 pp door\r\n\r\n Venue: PRESLEYS Pretoria, 2 Ernies Place, The Willows, Pretoria East\r\n\r\nTICKETS Online Quicket OR   WUP 082 446 5362', '2025-10-29 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 150.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/337648-jacquelines-experience-80s-90s-flashback/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7394_jacqueline_s_experience_80_s___90_s_flashback_29_oct_2025-10-29/poster/hhcLV602ewkX9TNMVoR5J5R1tYfPNWMyUMXQXYCM.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7394_jacqueline_s_experience_80_s___90_s_flashback_29_oct_2025-10-29\\/gallery\\/h5Ofso1imB28KGly2dTtkE9Zl7ZEu0MRDXdH3twK.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'club', NULL, 371, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-14 15:46:51', '2025-10-14 15:46:51'),
(204, 'No Friends Of Harry LIVE - Halloween Party! Woodstock Brewery', 'WirelessCowgirl Events and Rock It Real presents a Halloween party with none other than No Friends Of Harry! Yup… You read that right! Legendary South African Goth Rockers No Friends Of Harry who last played in SA almost nine years ago!\r\nSo… Dress-up in your best Halloween costumes join us for a night of Freaky Fun! \r\nDJ Squeek and Lukin Joshua will provide the entertainment before the main band. (Lukin Joshua will be performing a live set). \r\nDJ Squeek will play out the rest of the evening with nostalgic old school Goth and Alternative music.\r\nThis event forms part of the No Friends Of Harry “The Broken Generation Tour”. It’s also the launch of their long awaited “NO FRIENDS OF HARRY - THE BOX SET”. Which includes No Friends of Harry’s first three albums; One Came Running, Into the Valley and 15 Seconds, all with original cover designs, plus another full album choc full with rediscovered tracks, demos and live recordings on vinyl, all of which have been re-mastered from the original long-lost analogue tapes by legendary producer Matthew Fink together with the band. It will also include an album-sized printed photo and word booklet with a history of NFOH, and lyrics for all albums and more all lovingly packaged in a box. \r\nAdditional info:\r\nDoors open at 6pm\r\nTickets can be bought online via Quicket: R250 or for R350 at the door.\r\nQuicket Link: \r\nhttps://qkt.io/ZmkTld\r\nThere will be a NFOH merchandise table on the night!\r\nFor the fans travelling from afar or for those who prefer not to drive or Uber…. Why not consider booking a room at Riverlodge Backpackers 🏘at Oude Molen Eco Village 🏞 for the night! \r\nYou can even book a shuttle 🚐 to and from the venue, 4.9Kms away!\r\nACCOMODATION DISCOUNT VOUCHER....\r\nRiverlodge Backpackers has very kindly organised a 10% discount for NFOH fans…\r\nSimply use #RiverlodgeNFOH to receive a 10% discount on accommodation only (only those that use the hashtag in the emails/WhatsApp will receive the discount).\r\nNo Friends Of Harry:\r\nFormed in Johannesburg in 1986, No Friends Of Harry rightly claim the title of South Africa\'s first and most influential alternative/goth band, thanks to heavy rotation (primarily on Barney Simon\'s Shadow Show on the then “Radio 5”) and constant live appearances. \r\nFacebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100053261448026\r\nFacebook Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/2388509149/\r\nLukin Joshua:\r\nLukin Joshua is a Johannesburg-born, Cape Town-based indie solo singer-songwriter, loop artist, multi-instrumentalist and music producer. Lukin is known best for his ability to entertain crowds all over the country through the magic of looping different sounds and instruments over each other. Whether you\'re a canoe-on-a-pond kind of person, or a full-on adrenaline junkie, he\'s sure to get you moving. Lukin Joshua has shared the stage with the following SA artists and performed at the following festivals: - Springbok Nude Girls, Karen Zoid, Glaskas, Black Cat Bones, 4AM, Posterboy, Splashy Fen 2023.\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/LookInTime\r\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UChXMVqFAcnj3QtWDj82pY9Q\r\nDJ Squeek:\r\nDJ Squeek is passionate about South African music and has been in the industry since the late 80\'s. He was the music journalist for Cape Times’ “Top Of The Times” for 10 years and also wrote for magazines such as Your LMG, Stephen “Sugarman” Segerman’s SA Rock Digest. DJ Squeek presented the Western Cape gig guide every Tuesday Live on Barney Simon’s SA music show on Radio 2000 and has hosted and co-hosted many other radio shows (He is currently the presenter for Rock It Real). He was the music journalist for Cape Times’ “Top Of The Times” for 10 years. His first stage appearance was in front of over 2500 people, supporting “No Friends Of Harry” at the University of Cape Town Yellow Level where he met Barney Simon for the first time. DJ Squeek has played at many venues (The Playground, Mercury, The Stage, DecoDance, Delerium, Gandalf to name a few) and festivals including Up The Creek, Synergy Live, Ramfest, Rocking The Daisies and many other events. \r\nWireless Cowgirl Events:\r\nOwned and run by Alison Geduldt. She is a legend in her own right! Alison ran her own Music Production Company called MORE MUSIC CONCERTS Which included 3 hard-core concerts, 2 in JHB where she brought 5 Cape Town bands in a bus to play with 5 hard-core JHB Bands at The Newtown Cultural Centre at Mega Musics Venue and one in Cape Town. Bands included Hog Hoggidy Hog and Band Of Gypsys. Alison also did backstage co-ordination and hospitality for Iron Maiden’s drummer, Nicko McBrain.\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/wirelesscowgirl\r\nRock It Real:\r\nRock It Real was specifically created as a platform to bring undiscovered SA talent to the forefront and showcase bands that would usually be passed over by mainstream channels. Rock It Real is an SA music radio show hosted by DJ Squeek and broadcast LIVE from Cape Town, South Africa every Thursday from 8pm to Midnight (SAST).\r\nFacebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/RockItReal\r\nFacebook Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/rockitreal\r\nListen live: https://zeno.fm/radio/rock-it-real-ktjj/\r\nWoodstock Brewery:\r\nWoodstock Beerhall serves up an SA take on a Bavarian Beerhall. Situated at 252 Albert Road, Woodstock, Cape Town, South Africa, it’s home to some really amazing beers and has hosted many music events for quite a few iconic SA bands. \r\nThe venue has ample secure parking, food trucks, an amazing balcony and great vibe. \r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/WoodstockBrewery\r\nhttps://woodstockbrewery.co.za/\r\nRiverlodge Backpackers:\r\nIf you don’t want to drive or Uber after the gig, consider booking a room at Riverlodge Backpackers. They are just 10 minutes (4,9Kms) away from the Woodstock Brewery!!!\r\nRiverlodge Backpackers is based in Oude Molen Eco Village, Pinelands. It is the closest backpacking hostel to Cape Town International Airport and the city centre is a mere 12min drive away by either car or train. They offer a convenient on-site shuttle service and they’re also an accredited Baz Bus stop.\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Riverlodgebackpackers\r\nhttps://www.riverlodge.co.za\r\nMedia Enquiries: rockitreal@mymusicmatrix.com', '2025-10-31 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 250.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/330728-no-friends-of-harry-live-halloween-party-at-woodstock-brewery', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6402_no_friends_of_harry_live___halloween_party__woodstock_brewery_2025-10-31/poster/CcMCL7oz87qA7CJD9bfV8TsaoBcjl2skgy3cm1et.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6402_no_friends_of_harry_live___halloween_party__woodstock_brewery_2025-10-31\\/gallery\\/d9gn8nLV92BscRVPQ8K8mRemBeDfjVEZZmNv6LJz.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'club', NULL, 372, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-14 16:12:21', '2025-10-14 16:12:21'),
