(240, 'Beer Pong @ Gilroys 22 Oct', '🏓🍺 Beer Pong League at Gilroy’s! Think you’ve got the aim, the bounce, and the banter? Prove it every Wednesday from 7pm–9pm. Cold beer, fierce shots, and bragging rights on the line — this is where champions are made. 💥 📍 5 Achter Rd, Rivonia Crossing ☎️ 011 796 3020', '2025-10-22 00:00:00', '19:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2171_beer_pong___gilroys_22_oct_2025-10-22/poster/53ovNb8IsGYryhBfEgOt5zx1lPZUYufXVYSdWMjG.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2171_beer_pong___gilroys_22_oct_2025-10-22\\/gallery\\/TbHkZSjGBVO0mO8LDX03vsiMBXDUM20EtT5ixhdg.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'other', NULL, 47, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-15 20:05:17', '2025-10-15 20:05:17'),
