(284, 'The Rock Set LIVE at Jozi\'s!  15 Nov', '🎸 The Rock Set LIVE at Jozi\'s! 🎸\r\n\r\nGet ready to sing along! The Rock Set is hitting the stage to perform the greatest hits from your favourite legends:\r\n\r\nCCR\r\n\r\nAmerica\r\n\r\nDire Straits\r\n\r\nCliff Richard\r\n\r\nNeil Diamond\r\n\r\n...and much more!\r\n\r\nJoin us for a massive night of nostalgia and rock anthems!\r\n\r\nSaturday, 15th November\r\n\r\nJozi\'s Show Bar | Boundary Rd, North Riding AH\r\n(Your uber-friendly venue with delicious food available! 🍔🚕)\r\n\r\nEntrance: R100\r\n\r\nDon\'t miss out on this incredible tribute to rock history!', '2025-11-15 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 100.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7117_the_rock_set_live_at_jozi_s___15_nov_2025-11-15/poster/R8w4pNPfx4UH4roXRklWNWjjMFRF3tsGpSScZcV4.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7117_the_rock_set_live_at_jozi_s___15_nov_2025-11-15\\/gallery\\/o7zydqLfUb46uDzXGSMlWlS6sAyIWX0sukGXeNvR.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'club', NULL, 170, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-19 12:48:11', '2025-10-19 12:48:11'),
