(290, 'Morris Paige Benefit Concert', 'Super amped to be playing at a benefit concert for Morris Paige on Saturday 8 November at Adelaars Restaurant & Venue.\r\n\r\nMorris had a terrible bike accident recently and among other things broke his back and is in recovery. The benefit concert will help sort out his finances and support his family during this tough time.\r\n\r\nThe concert is free and is proudly put together by Pieter Botes of AMFI-pb.\r\n\r\nKeep SA music alive and we wil see you there.\r\n\r\nRich Man Blue', '2025-11-08 00:00:00', '10:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6066_morris_paige_benefit_concert_2025-11-08/poster/u0asY9bGiuF81xyCUAExXqxd9GQgFTW25XThZn5b.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6066_morris_paige_benefit_concert_2025-11-08\\/gallery\\/s1zlVdd9FsHob1g5HdSi6oqL4CgiIoKvC755Xsei.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', 'concert', NULL, 392, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-20 15:13:02', '2025-10-20 15:13:02'),
