(341, 'Koos Kombuis @ Railways Cullinan 16 Nov', 'Koos Kombuis at Railways Cullinan.\r\n\r\nSpandeer Sondag Middag saam Koos Kombuis by Railways Cafe Cullinan!\r\n\r\nThe legendary Koos Kombuis returns to Railways Café Cullinan for an afternoon of iconic music, stories, and pure South African nostalgia.\r\n\r\nJoin us in the beautiful theatre, great vibes, cold drinks, and tunes that shaped generations. Bring your friends, your family, and your love for good music - this one’s going to be special.\r\n\r\nPerformance time 1pm\r\n\r\nTickets\r\nR80 online\r\nR100 at the door', '2025-11-16 00:00:00', '12:00:00', 100.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2258_koos_kombuis___railways_cullinan_16_nov_2025-10-22/poster/Lu0bebnp1JbCGgmj4fFaJDrQPisneB4uADeD9VUU.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2258_koos_kombuis___railways_cullinan_16_nov_2025-10-22\\/gallery\\/YclTmH3f5YwXfON7Ip4qrrw3925bMvwmy28R8hli.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 358, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-22 14:56:20', '2025-10-22 14:56:20'),
