(369, 'SunBet ZX10 Masters @ Redstar Raceway Delmas 28-29 Nov', 'The SunBet ZX10 Masters Cup Club are once again hosting our very own round in November this year.\r\nWe are very fortunate to have the Classic Superbike Racing Association CSRA joining us for the event.\r\nIf you would be interested in coming through to set up a stand and show case your products at the track that weekend please send us an email to book your vendor spot. (spots are limited)\r\n\r\nhttps://www.redstarraceway.co.za/calendar.htm#calendar-c565eb3f-3783-48bf-bad8-82822da44337-event-m250r8b8\r\n\r\nEmail: zx10.masters@gmail.com\r\nWe look forward to seeing you there\r\nThank you to our sponsors who make this possible:\r\nSunbet\r\nBridgestone SA\r\nEBC Brakes\r\nVAG Automotive Centre Centurion', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '07:00:00', 100.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1941_sunbet_zx10_masters___redstar_raceway_delmas_28_29_nov_2025-10-23/poster/AzyCOaY8UDQCsr0TafHYMDmr9ouBmhXU1cNtrTzJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1941_sunbet_zx10_masters___redstar_raceway_delmas_28_29_nov_2025-10-23\\/gallery\\/zVt0kc9920fpzOo6ITOJn7u5D7FCrv1dq0xaPQ2A.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 408, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-23 14:48:28', '2025-10-23 14:48:28'),
