(377, 'Bring Back The Rock @ Krook & King 8 Nov', 'Bring Back The Rock is back after a 3 year hiatus on the 8th November 2025. Expect a line-up like no other to make up for lost time as our classic old school Rock Fest brings back the memories of festivals past.\r\nHit Music & Hit Events bring you this Epic Rock Show at a great new Venue - Krook & King by The Wedge Outdoor Park.\r\nWe have some incredible bands making up this year\'s line-up.\r\nCome join us in celebrating some of the best in South African Rock Music.\r\nWe will also have a market and there is a camping option available while there are spots left.\r\nMore details to follow ongoing.\r\nPlease send us a mail on info@hitmusic.co.za for any advertising or sponsor opportunities.\r\nLine-Up :\r\nJasper Dan\r\nMan As Machine\r\nLunae Lane\r\nScream In Colours\r\nBroke n Free\r\nAfter Wonderland\r\nThe Barcode Bandits\r\nAfter Agatha', '2025-11-08 00:00:00', '16:00:00', 100.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/299188-bring-back-the-rock-2025/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1040_bring_back_the_rock___krook___king_8_nov_2025-10-23/poster/GhkxOIeih5TArwrn6iCP3hv4NKkVJN53CgZoRfvx.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1040_bring_back_the_rock___krook___king_8_nov_2025-10-23\\/gallery\\/6xgmJIkWuqMwpSjVV72FMpEtaPo8GILCCzKCPypi.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8463_bring_back_the_rock___krook___king_8_nov_2025-11-08\\/gallery\\/OdYdOk4YuZlFFl6qM4ftYSkSqbamYN1CePGdN5md.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 291, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-23 20:07:55', '2025-10-27 15:15:03'),
