(384, 'Dirty Friday @ CLub Chevelle 24 Oct', 'Edenvale, get ready to lose your mind – \"Dirty Fridays Vol. 1\" is about to blow the roof off Club Chevelle! 🔥\r\nSavage Shows brings bass-heavy chaos with one of the biggest events Edenvale has ever seen – a full-spectrum sonic assault of Techno, Psytrance, and Drum ‘n’ Bass powered by 10 next-level DJs who are ready to take you deep into the night 🌃\r\nStep into a pulsating world of dark beats, hypnotic rhythms, and high-voltage energy, where the Techno heads, Psytrance freaks, and DnB warriors unite under one roof. This isn’t just a party – it’s a movement, a bass-driven ritual, a Friday you’ll never forget 🔊\r\nYour DJ lineup for the night:\r\n19h00 - A.DIN B2B LOOT\r\n20h00 - MATTER\r\n21h00 - RETROFUTURE\r\n22h00 - TRIFEKTA\r\n23h00 - HORN BOY\r\n00h00 - DAAGANJA\r\n01h00 - DIRTYPANDA B2B NEPTUNE B2B SUPASYNC\r\n🎟️ Tickets: R50 online \r\n(Quicket: https://www.quicket.co.za/.../337759-dirty-friday.../...) \r\n| R100 at the door\r\n📍 Location: Club Chevelle, Edenvale\r\n📅 Date: Friday, 07 November 2025\r\nThis is Volume 1 – be there for the birth of a new era 🕺💃', '2025-10-24 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 100.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4803_dirty_friday___club_chevelle_24_oct_2025-10-24/poster/VYPvpUVlxNfBxXFHw9qV8BiM2ff3RofbmcIegNvY.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4803_dirty_friday___club_chevelle_24_oct_2025-10-24\\/gallery\\/p3iNDLc9ZMjS6HdAHBSFSICfur6Pwzno4HhAiyZF.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 106, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-24 13:44:30', '2025-10-24 13:44:44'),
