(387, '🎃 Halloween @ Gilroy’s! 👻 31 Oct', '🎃 Halloween at Gilroy’s! 👻\r\n\r\nJoin us Friday, 31 October from 7–9PM for a night of spooky fun!\r\n\r\n✨ Free entrance\r\n🧛‍♀️ Live performance by Khaleesi - 5-9pm\r\n🥃 Free shot on entry if you’re dressed for the occasion\r\n🏆 Over R5000 in prizes for the Best Dressed — voting starts at 9PM!\r\n\r\nCold beers, creepy vibes, and killer costumes — it’s going to be a scream. 🍻💀\r\n\r\n📞 Book your table now: 011 796 3020\r\n\r\nT’s & C’s apply.\r\n\r\n📍 5 Achter Rd, Rivonia Crossing\r\n\r\n#GilroysHalloween #RivoniaNights #GilroysVibes #SpookySeason #UpYours', '2025-10-31 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3172______halloween___gilroy___s_______31_oct_2025-10-24/poster/LoASsuzd6mr8sOIR8VZUuwbfkn1teSKlYpAJNan7.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3172______halloween___gilroy___s_______31_oct_2025-10-24\\/gallery\\/4w5NCH77JiSDFFeKMqyR6LF92GFEy3TOqJoRMIyS.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 47, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-24 16:39:24', '2025-10-24 16:39:24'),
(388, 'Landman @ Hennies Jolly Prawn 26 Oct', '☠️🏴‍☠️ Ahoy, me hearties! The weekend be upon us! 🏴‍☠️☠️\r\n\r\nFriday marks the grand start o’ our weekend adventures! Gather yer crew and set sail for a feast fit fer a captain — our mouthwaterin’ Eapetada awaits ye! 🍖🔥\r\n\r\nThen brace yer sea legs, ‘cause Sunday be a storm o’ excitement — Landman be takin’ the stage live, and we’ll be drawin’ our VIP Lucky Draw for the legendary Steve Hofmeyr show! 🎶⚓\r\n\r\nBe there or be walkin’ the plank, ye scallywags! 🏴‍☠️🍻', '2025-10-26 00:00:00', '13:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2546_landman___hennies_jolly_prawn_26_oct_2025-10-24/poster/g7R7ilmwYaFZJNqhMyVBsGOfenRtdyp8vBRfEcpQ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2546_landman___hennies_jolly_prawn_26_oct_2025-10-24\\/gallery\\/3VAklmfDDo1diBQ4wNE81LRTxYuI3qmIQry453yF.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 5, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-24 16:41:01', '2025-10-24 16:41:01'),
(389, 'Chasing Rabbits – a Woodstock Experience @ Roux Cafe 2 Nov', 'When the organisers of the original Woodstock Music and Art Fair first set their plans in motion in 1969, they anticipated sales of fifty thousand tickets. Roughly three times as many were sold. Attendance peaked at nearly half a million. It was an event that would help to define an entire generation and continue to influence music into the present day.\r\n\r\nJump down the rabbit-hole with us & recapture some of that free spirit at the lovely Café Roux in Noordhoek, Cape Town, as we pay tribute to some of the legendary acts & artists that first took the stage on a farm outside Bethel, New York, 1969.\r\n\r\nAll music will be performed Live by CrowFoot, a local outfit well known for its passionate & powerful renditions of music from this era.\r\n\r\nTickets sold at R180 per person. Music starts at 6 pm. Be sure to book ahead.\r\n\r\n“Remember what the dormouse said”', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 180.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7011_chasing_rabbits_____a_woodstock_experience___roux_cafe_2_nov_2025-10-24/poster/qVsAwa8i6azvmPFJ7fSs8iUzJPCjk6ftN3BMsfTV.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7011_chasing_rabbits_____a_woodstock_experience___roux_cafe_2_nov_2025-10-24\\/gallery\\/WAkSDir0aMkLjMcKlB9MCY6v6fReouYkk2J82C7O.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 416, 'superuser', 5, '2025-10-24 16:59:35', '2025-10-24 16:59:35'),
