(426, 'Juan Boucher @ Rosetulee 12 Dec', '🎤 Juan Boucher Live in Brakpan!\r\nPresented by none other than Rosetulee- this December!\r\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening of music and memories as Juan Boucher takes the stage, joined by the incredible Taye and Len Muller.\r\n📅 Date: [12 December 2025]\r\n📍 Location: 189 Dirk van der Hoff str, Dalview, Brakpan\r\n🎶 A night filled with soulful sounds, good vibes, and top-tier entertainment.\r\n🎟️ Tickets are selling fast - get yours now!\r\n🍽️ Table bookings now open!🔥🔥🔥', '2025-12-12 00:00:00', '18:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2069_juan_boucher___rosetulee_12_dec_2025-12-12/poster/C3x3BRxb4RyuvTWdDTCUB7o4sjkzbOPtVQxcAeoJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2069_juan_boucher___rosetulee_12_dec_2025-12-12\\/gallery\\/qMizBrVc8t9x6p1e9HtzFF4XHbhOYNqkWPf5bwxR.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 237, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-26 17:03:20', '2025-10-26 17:03:20'),
