(436, 'Halloween at Truth 1 Nov', 'On the 1st of November 2025 we celebrate Halloween at Truth\r\n3 Internationals and a local lineup packing serious weight\r\nTerrace, Room Four, Upstairs, Courtyard and Basement - Carrying the sound across every corner of the club - 5 Floors. One Night. Nothing but the Underground!\r\nCostumes aren’t just welcome, they’re essential - This is the one night where the Truth family comes together, transforms into the shadows, spirits, and everything in between', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '20:00:00', 250.00, 'https://www.truthjhb.co.za/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7635_halloween_at_truth_1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/3TNox7I6ws1RHIl4cUXCsy3ymZQ7QWN6dPGeFtc9.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7635_halloween_at_truth_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/bRaCB3NkTSiblGCtpVc2I1ZQFMIDcpzbYPibkEQl.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 390, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 12:33:52', '2025-10-27 12:33:52'),
