(440, '24hr Dia De Los iLamuna – 5yr Anniversary Race! @ Redstar Raceway Delmas 31 Oct - 2 Nov', '🍋🔥 24hr Dia De Los iLamuna – 5yr Anniversary Race! 🔥🍋\r\nAmigos, it’s time to celebrate 5 years of chaos, colour & clapped-out cars at the wildest 24hr race in SA!\r\n🗓️ 30 Oct – 2 Nov 2025\r\n📍 Redstar Raceway\r\nJoin the fiesta:\r\n• Themed track, music & madness\r\n• Prizes for best-dressed lemons, wildest pit setups & most epic comebacks\r\n• Bonus laps for brilliance, penalty laps for creative accounting\r\n• Build your lemon for around R55k (car + prep)\r\n• Entry: R27,562 ex VAT per team (includes tyres, shirts, caps, bands & branding kit)\r\nKey dates:\r\n• Thurs 30 Oct: Dinner & party\r\n• Fri 31 Oct: Practice & Qualifying\r\n• Sat 1 Nov: 24hr race starts (Le Mans style!)\r\n• Sun 2 Nov: Race ends, legends crowned\r\n🍋🏁 This isn’t just motorsport. It’s Motorspirit! 🍋🏁\r\nNo divas, just dedication, duct tape & gees.\r\n*Think you and your crew have what it takes? 50% of entries have been pre-sold so enter now to be part of this epic celebration of motorsport*\r\nReply here or contact Mark/Joy for details.\r\nmark@doepicshitadventures.com joy@doepicshitadv', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '08:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5382_24hr_dia_de_los_ilamuna_____5yr_anniversary_race____redstar_raceway_delmas_31_oct___1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/NMMO4AUuTYlYd4tjPQen5ZaAmZDCfTuNRp1iNAQu.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5382_24hr_dia_de_los_ilamuna_____5yr_anniversary_race____redstar_raceway_delmas_31_oct___1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/i6aCkH2jXatBla7jptmMll1h68HgMO3uhO3XCH1N.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5382_24hr_dia_de_los_ilamuna_____5yr_anniversary_race____redstar_raceway_delmas_31_oct___1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/lHCLbSwdWWXyBGQAz40TvdRwZLRigoCYY7gDqmGg.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5382_24hr_dia_de_los_ilamuna_____5yr_anniversary_race____redstar_raceway_delmas_31_oct___1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/tfw3NJ