(442, 'Rebels Night Market Halloween @ Garden on Zeiss 31 Oct', '🎃👻 Rebels Night Market: Halloween 👻🎃\r\nGet ready for a frightfully fun night out at the Rebels Night Market: Halloween Edition!\r\n🗓️ Date: Friday, 31 October\r\n🕔 Time: 5PM – 10PM\r\n📍 Location: GArden on Zeiss, 1 Zeiss Rd, Honeydew\r\n💰 Entrance: R30 per person\r\nJoin us for a spine-tingling evening packed with:\r\n🍬 Kids\' Trick or Treat Trail\r\n🕸️ Best Dressed Contest (come in your creepiest, cutest, or most creative costume!)\r\n📸 Spooky Photo Ops\r\n🛍️ Incredible Alternative & Craft Vendors\r\n🎁 Surprise Giveaways & Ghoulish Goodies\r\n...and lots of spooky surprises haunting the night!\r\nThis is one Halloween night market you don’t want to miss – whether you\'re a creature of the night or just in it for the candy.\r\n🦇 Costumes encouraged. Chills guaranteed.\r\n📲 Hit “Going” and invite your coven, your crew, or your familiars!\r\nIn association with Alternatribe & HeartSpace Events', '2025-10-31 00:00:00', '17:00:00', 30.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5543_rebels_night_market_halloween___garden_on_zeiss_31_oct_2025-10-31/poster/99lePqFf100VIVYbPDB5CnFOO3UkjzzjKFNSYOve.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5543_rebels_night_market_halloween___garden_on_zeiss_31_oct_2025-10-31\\/gallery\\/d6CpCvjApC6Os3koabGt4CBuf8uxMqzuyPcGJ2ar.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 356, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 15:29:30', '2025-10-27 15:37:16'),
(443, 'The Party Rockers @ Bailey\'s 1 Nov', '🎉 The Party Rockers are BACK — and LIVE on the Bailey’s stage this Saturday, 1 Nov!\r\nFormerly known as The Bailey’s Bulleys, they’re ready to light up the night with all your favourite party covers 🔥\r\n🎸 R70 Entry | From 6pm | No under 21s\r\nBook your tables NOW! Call 066 268 2803', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 70.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7270_the_party_rockers___bailey_s_1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/KTzphLRHVyZd9UsULoUrmZ6HsRA32AaExU8WUISC.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7270_the_party_rockers___bailey_s_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/FA6cJdqnt2gODpm6hscF2GShIACgIShBjddba6ly.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 76, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 15:36:12', '2025-10-27 15:36:12'),
(444, 'Strab 2026 @ Ponta Malongane, Mozambique on 27-31 May 2026', '🗓 Festival dates: 27 - 31 May 2026\r\n⛺ General Camping, Group Camping and Day Ticket sales open on 15 NOVEMBER 2025!\r\n🏡 Chalet and Log Hut Accommodation Tickets will open on 1 MARCH 2026.\r\n\r\nPonta Malongane in the South of beautiful Mozambique sets the scene for our yearly celebration of blues, rock, folk and fantastic people! Whether it\'s your first or twentyfirst STRAB - you\'re in for a treat!\r\nTickets will be availble on www.strab.co.za from 12:00 noon on the launch date.\r\nLet your friends know... but only the good ones 😉\r\n\r\n#STRAB2026', '2026-05-27 00:00:00', '10:00:00', 300.00, 'https://strab.co.za/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6621_strab_2026___ponta_malongane__mozambique_on_27_31_may_2026_2026-05-27/poster/LHTUUDa73T3vns3tyb5embNQeLIVtXVvL0KlIreg.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6621_strab_2026___ponta_malongane__mozambique_on_27_31_may_2026_2026-05-27\\/gallery\\/8woYd3bvnIo2TGROPAERa46mcg5XQD5ykFil2Qv9.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 223, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 16:11:30', '2025-10-27 16:11:30'),
