(448, 'Karel Bester @ Col\'Cacchio Durbanville 29 Oct', 'One of our local faves is back! 🎸\r\nJoin us at Col’Cacchio Durbanville, Wednesday, 29 October at 6pm for live music with the one and only Karel Bester!\r\nExpect good vibes, great food, and the smooth sounds you know and love. 🍕🍷✨\r\nEntrance is free but be sure to secure your table. Call us to book: 021 976 7750\r\nhttps://www.colcacchio.co.za/restaurant/durbanville', '2025-10-29 00:00:00', '18:00:00', NULL, 'https://www.colcacchio.co.za/restaurant/durbanville', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4760_karel_bester___col_cacchio_durbanville_29_oct_2025-10-29/poster/nkrIJHqdhP6CaNc4YiNwXjIGsCP8Mb84fl0wlIKV.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4760_karel_bester___col_cacchio_durbanville_29_oct_2025-10-29\\/gallery\\/k4y2khvm6ahedG8WMK1jE09v0n7ADAN7J9eOC4C0.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 445, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 16:45:58', '2025-10-27 16:45:58'),
