(455, 'Dee Dewald - West Rand Potjiekos Cook off @ Hobby Park 2 Nov', 'Dee Dewald @ Hobby Park 2 Nov\r\nJoin Us for a Sunday Out in Nature – Jozi Style!\r\nGet ready for a fun-filled day under the South African sun as teams cook up a delicious storm of Potjiekos dishes – the true Mzansi way!\r\nAll proceeds from the event will be donated to the Roodepoort/Krugersdorp SPCA, supporting their incredible work for animals in need.\r\n🎟️ Buy your tickets to taste a variety of mouthwatering Potjie flavors, enjoy the vibrant atmosphere, and spend a beautiful day in our very own Jozi backyard.\r\nCome for the food, stay for the fun, and support a great cause!', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4628_dee_dewald___hobby_park_2_nov_2025-11-02/poster/Gh0nPKmLftD7TQI5eBRCU0inMqxKwoxKT8dR0bWE.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4628_dee_dewald___hobby_park_2_nov_2025-11-02\\/gallery\\/5nQc6A0RwZmX5cl6DYpGCh0Ah12GFrOdCkC6rrZH.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 447, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 17:45:01', '2025-10-27 17:47:17'),
