(458, 'Field Market - Christmas and November 2025 Edition - 8 Nov', '🎄🎁🎉 Our biggest and brightest market of the year is back…join us for our 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟱 𝗖𝗵𝗿𝗶𝘀𝘁𝗺𝗮𝘀 𝗺𝗮𝗿𝗸𝗲𝘁𝘀 at the Field & Study park! 🤩\r\nCelebrate the season the South African way with sunshine, good vibes and festive cheer! 🇿🇦☀️😎🥂\r\n✨ Expect:\r\n🎁 Unique & affordable Christmas gifts\r\n❤️ Local & handmade goods\r\n🥐🧀🍯 Artisan deli treats\r\n🍔🌯🍕 Gourmet food stalls\r\n🍻🍹 Craft drinks\r\n🎶 Live music\r\n🧒 Kids play area & activities\r\n🦮 Pet-friendly (well-behaved dogs on leash)\r\n🚘 Ample parking\r\n🔒 On-site security\r\n🎅 Plus:\r\n🎄 “Find the Elf” activity for all ages\r\n📮 Santa’s letter box\r\n🎁 A special visit from Father Christmas!\r\n❤️ Support small businesses this festive season - shop local, eat local, love local ❤️\r\n*******************\r\nOPEN: 9am to 3pm\r\n*******************\r\nADDRESS:\r\n- Field & Study Park, 11 Louise avenue, Parkmore, Sandton\r\n- GPS coordinates: -26.087046, 28.029305\r\n- Search Field Market on Google Maps\r\n*******************\r\nPARKING:\r\n- Ample parking available\r\n- R10 per car on main parking field (security provided)\r\n*******************\r\nENTRY:\r\n- Free entry\r\n- All ages welcome / Family Friendly\r\n- Well-behaved dogs on a leash welcome (water points provided)\r\n- Camping chairs / Picnic blankets welcome\r\n- No alcohol served to u/18\'s\r\n- No ATM on site, cash accepted but preferred payment method is via credit card\r\n*******************\r\nFACILITIES:\r\n✔ Live acoustic music in main seating area\r\n✔ Child friendly - Large free play area / Horse rides / Sand art / Ceramic painting / Free Nature scavenger hunt\r\n✔ Curated stalls selling local & handmade products (no imported products allowed)\r\n✔ Deli stalls\r\n✔ Gourmet food & beverage stalls\r\n✔ Craft Beer, Cocktails, Gin Bar, Wine, & Liqueur\r\n✔ Medic on site\r\n✔ Toilets\r\n✔ Security\r\n*******************\r\nPROHIBITED ITEMS:\r\n✖ NO own food & snacks (Will be on sale at the venue)\r\n✖ NO Alcohol (Will be on sale at the venue)\r\n✖ NO Beverages (Will be on sale at the venue)\r\n✖ NO cooler-boxes\r\n✖ NO Gazebos/tents in market seating area\r\n✖ NO Pets behaving badly and pets without leashes\r\n✖ NO Weapons, firearms and Illegal substances\r\n✖ Any items deemed by security or management to be dangerous or disruptive', '2025-11-08 00:00:00', '09:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3292_field_market___christmas_and_november_2025_edition___8_nov_2025-11-08/poster/AZjGLCYE6l4Cx1rm7jgCnrl8u6f6kKSmO1Zr35WE.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3292_field_market___christmas_and_november_2025_edition___8_nov_2025-11-08\\/gallery\\/lcI0EjLN95ppXtfyGK5vMFiIKLZVcjIxPFAzA0zH.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 34, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-27 20:05:15', '2025-10-27 20:05:15'),
