(473, 'Steve Hofmery @ Padstal Lynnwood 22 Nov', '🎤🇿🇦 STEVE HOFMEYR LIVE @ PADSTAL LYNNWOOD! 🇿🇦🎤\r\nA night you don’t want to miss! The legendary Steve Hofmeyr takes the Padstal stage for a one-night-only performance filled with hits, stories, and pure South African gees! 🎶🔥\r\n📅 Saturday, 22 November\r\n🕘 From 21:00\r\n🎟️ FREE ENTRY\r\n📍 Padstal Lynnwood – 265 The Highway Street\r\n📞 061 680 3388\r\n🍻 Great food • 🎶 Great music • 💚 Great gees\r\nCome early — this one’s going to be packed!', '2025-11-22 00:00:00', '21:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1088_steve_hofmery___padstal_lynnwood_22_nov_2025-11-22/poster/ykrnb5Dy7ZzwaF5r5QKjUZtnFw7LbJtF0KkEs9N6.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1088_steve_hofmery___padstal_lynnwood_22_nov_2025-11-22\\/gallery\\/Azdg9gqfyJKxPnEQNfH1XT1vvjFC7X8DUm6HWB4J.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 458, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-28 14:42:18', '2025-10-28 14:42:18'),
(474, 'Springboks v Japan @ Molly Malone\'s 1 Nov', 'Springboks v Japan @ Molly Malone\'s 1 Nov', '2025-11-01 00:00:00', '18:10:00', NULL, NULL, 'artists/art_daveartist11_8683/events/event_5279_springboks_v_japan___molly_malone_s_1_nov_2025-11-01/poster/CaKf9c0RMlb8RvdIrMQ15BtEIXxvbyUwFBt6EKlg.jpg', '[\"artists\\/art_daveartist11_8683\\/events\\/event_5279_springboks_v_japan___molly_malone_s_1_nov_2025-11-01\\/gallery\\/b91TgB7fXJlNYnftW4XxhTrtGiAtDa9TCNbWqfgP.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 54, 'artist', 40, '2025-10-28 15:48:18', '2025-10-28 15:48:18'),
(475, 'THE PARKVIEW CHRISTMAS MARKET', 'Get ready for fairy lights, festive tunes, and the irresistible smell of Christmas pancakes, yes you guessed it, The Parkview Christmas Market is back! From 21–23 November, George Hay Park transforms into a sparkling winter wonderland filled with laughter, live music and local love, all in support of Nicarela Charity and our amazing beneficiaries. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHere’s what’s waiting for you:\r\n\r\nThe Vibe:\r\n\r\n Golden Jozi sunsets, a bubbly in hand, oysters on ice, and kids giggling in the Tinker Colour Studio Kids Zone. Music fills the park with performances from Hiding Bigfoot, Steve Walls, Swamp Dog, Gavin Hooker, plus rising stars Swimmer and Gift, as well as local school groups. Everywhere you look — lights, smiles and that warm sense of community. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFeast Mode:\r\n\r\n Treat yourself to your favourites from SLAPS and Tei Avon, or swing by the legendary Nicarela Pancake Stand (Christmas calories don’t count). Plus, a variety of other delicious vendors to satisfy every craving in between!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSip & Sparkle:\r\n\r\n Indulge at the Champagne & Oyster Bar with Kleine Zalze wines, smoked trout sandwiches, artisanal cheese boards, and the festive magic of Agar’s Brewery. Your perfect Jozi summer night awaits!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nShop Local Love:\r\n\r\n Explore 75+ stalls filled with gifts, crafts, art and festive finds. Returning favourites like Exotic Kashmir, Burst Botannicals, Loomd Cotton, Bespoke Creations & Epa!, alongside plenty of new treasures, make this the ultimate Christmas shopping experience.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBoks vs Ireland – playing live @19:40 at the Parkview Christmas Market!\r\n\r\nMovie Night in the Park – Sat 22 Nov @ 19:30: Bring blankets, bring friends, and bring your festive gees! (Chairs to the back, please)\r\n\r\nEvery laugh, bite, sip, and song supports:\r\n\r\nThe Living Link\r\nBethany House Trust\r\nMES\r\nGuild Cottage\r\n\r\n\r\nDates: 21–23 November 2025\r\n\r\nOpening Times: \r\n\r\n	Friday:  		15:00 - 22:00\r\n\r\n	Saturday:  	10:00 - 22:00\r\n\r\n	Sunday:  	10:00 - 16:00\r\n\r\nLocation: George Hay Park, Parkview\r\n\r\nTickets: R60 Adults | Kids Free | Kids Zone All-Day R60', '2025-11-21 00:00:00', '15:00:00', 60.00, NULL, 'artists/art_daveartist11_8683/events/event_5028_the_parkview_christmas_market_2025-11-21/poster/xLpGQaco7yhLs5SPOAUNBpvx4F4iOesdF0qLlkAX.jpg', '[\"artists\\/art_daveartist11_8683\\/events\\/event_5028_the_parkview_christmas_market_2025-11-21\\/gallery\\/LZN465M8NpHkrFkxAeYujTwqU3N2lMosISRqdzRj.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 459, 'artist', 40, '2025-10-28 16:03:58', '2025-10-28 16:03:58'),
