(496, 'Grant Tregellas @ Hogshead Rock Cottage 2 Nov', 'Who said Sundays are for naps when Grant Tregellas is on stage? 🎸🔥 He’s bringing the music that’ll have you swapping the couch for a cold one and the remote for a burger. 🍔🍻\r\n\r\nWith live tunes, food and drink specials, Sunday’s looking wide awake. 😉\r\n\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Sunday, 02 November 2025 from 17:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Rock Cottage Shopping Centre, c/o John Vorster & Christiaan de Wet Road, Weltevredenpark\r\n— at Hogshead Rock Cottage.', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1859_grant_tregellas___hogshead_rock_cottage_2_nov_2025-11-02/poster/9ISb1rk0TqVwqCq0IbdQh9Lxcs0pLbAVC9EN460x.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1859_grant_tregellas___hogshead_rock_cottage_2_nov_2025-11-02\\/gallery\\/HFEy2oAwutfAYrkDlnblPeFcZ70Vb1QOqKM5HjB0.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 55, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-29 15:40:43', '2025-10-29 16:14:11'),
(497, 'Richard Thompson @ Papoulis 29 Oct', 'We will be changing it up a little on Wednesday. Live music featuring Richard Thompson from 5pm!\r\nA free glass of wine with any main course order!\r\nPizza specials and local deliveries are available. Call us on 0724206740 for more information or to book your table. We are at Shop 1, Kingfisher Shopping Centre, Kingfisher Avenue, Fourways (next to the Spar).\r\nTs and Cs apply.', '2025-10-29 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9079_richard_thompson___papoulis_29_oct_2025-10-29/poster/2MrBEyzQhOxYhiXuNgCneBORn2YtioP1HDM80sHT.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9079_richard_thompson___papoulis_29_oct_2025-10-29\\/gallery\\/bu0sVSLgNVlxyWNFj8xRfciQrsTcephS8KLGnuBN.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 217, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-29 15:57:04', '2025-10-29 15:57:04'),
