(503, 'Dylan @ Moo Moos Silver Lakes 2 Nov', 'Hey Everyone. Busy week up ahead and loads to look forward to from New song Release #Wishyouwerehere to Radio interviews and live performances. \r\nSo make sure to Pre Save Wish you were here https://linktr.ee/dylantori\r\nOr tune into the Radio interviews or catch me live at the following Venues\r\nThursday 30th- @ Lapa Pub - Fourways Gardens Shopping Centre - 19H00\r\nFriday & Saturday Corporate functions\r\nSunday- @ Moo Moo Silver Lakes -16H00\r\nThank you\r\nDylan Tori', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '16:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7411_dylan___moo_moos_silver_lakes_2_nov_2025-11-02/poster/PEpOSo28mkE6Shyf583qAKsqGnzpGUZGUeOr4wJh.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7411_dylan___moo_moos_silver_lakes_2_nov_2025-11-02\\/gallery\\/5KIPQWf3Vp6MUN15pfmcq6wBcm10o3EAMLgwa4n8.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 466, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-29 20:51:22', '2025-10-29 20:52:46'),
(504, 'Jack Atlantic @ Hogshead Douglasdale 2 Nov', 'Sunday plans? Found them. 🎸🔥 Jack Atlantic is live at Hogshead Douglasdale this Sunday, bringing a set that turns a casual afternoon into a full-blown vibe. Add in our food and drink specials, and you’ve got the perfect excuse to stretch the weekend just a little longer. 🍔🍻😉\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Sunday, 02 November 2025 from 17:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Douglasdale Village Shopping Centre c/o Leslie Avenue & Douglas Drive', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9374_jack_atlantic___hogshead_douglasdale_2_nov_2025-11-02/poster/YUKhfV5Wb0rrL2XoiCvaqusfsVH8f0BbzdP5X2H6.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9374_jack_atlantic___hogshead_douglasdale_2_nov_2025-11-02\\/gallery\\/Agc04E34qo4Pte1zDvm5goihjGbbpqzbGqQJxWZY.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 31, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-29 21:46:13', '2025-10-29 21:46:13'),
(505, 'Anton van Rooyen @ Hogshead Rock Cottage 31 Oct', 'Friday nights are for good food, loud guitars, and bad decisions you’ll laugh about later. 😉🎸 Anton van Rooyen is live at Hogshead Rock Cottage this Friday, serving up the soundtrack to your weekend alongside our flame-grilled food and drink specials. Bring your friends, we’ll handle the fun part. 🔥\r\n\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Friday, 31 October 2025 from 20:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Rock Cottage Shopping Centre, c/o John Vorster & Christiaan de Wet Road, Weltevredenpark', '2025-10-31 00:00:00', '20:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6480_anton_van_rooyen___hogshead_rock_cottage_31_oct_2025-10-31/poster/nz3jwF6DJlTI1QUaRS4bI2aL0XgLlV8bVANp1M4i.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6480_anton_van_rooyen___hogshead_rock_cottage_31_oct_2025-10-31\\/gallery\\/Qp3CVccRAvvaezHmgxD2INcYUsjts35G1bCUgq4S.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 55, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-30 01:28:28', '2025-10-30 01:28:28'),
