(507, '𝐂𝐫𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐤 @ Railways Cafe Irene 2 Nov', '𝐂𝐫𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐚𝐥 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐤 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐁𝐀𝐂𝐊 with a new track “𝑮𝒊𝒗𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒖𝒑 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑮𝒉𝒐𝒔𝒕” and to mark this auspicious occasion, we’re doing some shows! 🤠\r\n\r\nCrystal Park LIVE with friends Hollowbody, Tea & Oranges & Lunae Lane - Railways Cafe - Sun 2 Novl\r\n\r\nJoin us for one helluva proper Sunday Hoe-down at Railways Cafe Irene on 𝗦𝗨𝗡 𝟮 𝗡𝗢𝗩 from 1pm alongside some very good friends of ours:\r\n- Hollowbody\r\n- Tea & Oranges\r\n- LunÆ Lane\r\n\r\nPLUS we will be celebrating 𝑺𝒕𝒆𝒗𝒆 𝑬𝒂𝒔𝒕’𝒔 𝒃𝒊𝒓𝒕𝒉𝒅𝒂𝒚 on the day so come on down and get those feet a-tappin’ and boots a-stompin’! 🤠\r\n\r\n🎟 𝐓𝐈𝐂𝐊𝐄𝐓 𝐈𝐍𝐅𝐎 🎟\r\nGo to www.railwayscafe.co.za\r\n- CLICK the \"GET TICKETS\" button at the top of the screen\r\n- 𝗚𝗲𝘁 𝗮 𝗗𝗜𝗦𝗖𝗢𝗨𝗡𝗧𝗘𝗗 𝗧𝗜𝗖𝗞𝗘𝗧 𝗳𝗼𝗿 𝗥𝟭𝟬𝟬*!\r\n- Tickets at the Door: R150 (cards accepted ONLY)\r\n\r\nBrought to you by Rockford Media\r\n\r\nCrystal Park\'s brand new tune “𝑮𝒊𝒗𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒖𝒑 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝑮𝒉𝒐𝒔𝒕” to be released to all major streaming platforms soon - stay tuned!\r\n\r\n*price listed is before fees', '2025-11-02 00:00:00', '13:00:00', 100.00, 'https://fixr.co/event/crystal-park-live-with-friends-hollowbody-tea-oran-tickets-734178375', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1835_________________________________________________railways_cafe_irene_2_nov_2025-11-02/poster/kdars5cPj91LHZXvyikI4eGOzCDOSzjdvWMuhQzE.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1835_________________________________________________railways_cafe_irene_2_nov_2025-11-02\\/gallery\\/WdiNWRxPUWzIDjkfqJkLEWloUsUUjBNEaV3WXUtq.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-30 13:18:02', '2025-10-30 13:18:02'),
