(509, 'Crossways Village Market 23 Nov', 'A Market-Experience under Blue Gum Trees! LIVE Music, Food Trucks, Farmers, Gin & Craft Beer, homemade delicacies, arts & crafts, toys, fashion, décor, plants & flowers; over 120 stalls! Loads of kiddies activities including Pony Rides & Face Painting and Train rides. Bring your best friend on a lead. We are Wheelchair friendly. Our market is a safe space for the whole family to enjoy.\r\nFREE ENTRANCE!\r\n9am - 2pm\r\nCastle Ridge Drive, Thornhill, halfway between Port Elizabeth & Jeffreys Bay\r\nFor more info contact organizer Lana Sim: 083 572 1858', '2025-11-23 00:00:00', '09:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2647_crossways_village_market_23_nov_2025-11-23/poster/oLFdryua7KBshYl70OWSFDXV1cUH51PPJHfV53I2.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2647_crossways_village_market_23_nov_2025-11-23\\/gallery\\/utIRB50V5cvP0mj8XF9zUPM4oXcOLJf5wHsdlxQM.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 469, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-30 14:53:36', '2025-10-30 14:53:36'),
(510, 'Last Blast @ Sognage 15 Nov', 'For the LAST BLAST. We had to have power houses @grift.hxc to DEMOLISH @sognage with is on the 15th of NOV!! \r\nThey have been touring the country kicking ass and taking names!! #l\r\nHaven’t seen them live? Then yoh, best get yourself a ticket and come jol HARD!!! \r\nThey throwing down with the machines @sunken_state @walk_these_skies @handpickedheathens @humannebula and @hilliker.slamz ⚡️\r\nTicket link in bio!! \r\nSee you there you animals.', '2025-11-15 00:00:00', '15:00:00', 250.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6438_last_blast___sognage_15_nov_2025-11-15/poster/2YGSc73nEIsD3uJaQInuNd3nSQN7bZv8Bj4sTmP0.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6438_last_blast___sognage_15_nov_2025-11-15\\/gallery\\/GGlEh0hQDF2wE4POpWG6Au0mvNlg94OIxFHJjJTw.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6438_last_blast___sognage_15_nov_2025-11-15\\/gallery\\/lcuwZrU48UjLNzQNilNImbXl9YOkircLWQccde7S.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 57, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-30 15:57:17', '2025-10-30 15:57:17'),
(511, 'Keira Witherkay @ Rondebosch Golf Club 3 Nov', '‼️Join us next Monday for a fantastic night of music featuring the expansive sounds of Keira Witherkay who brings three decades of global performing experience to our local stage; alongside the intimate and intricate guitar playing of poet and singer-songwriter Len Verwey; and finally our headline act, the energetic, reverb-soaked surf-guitar band of Krakatoa, now enhanced with a live horn section!\r\n\r\nDoors open at 6:30 PM, music kicking off at 7:30 PM.\r\n\r\nBOOKINGS: 021 689 4176\r\n\r\nVENUE:\r\nRondebosch Golf Club\r\nKlipfontein Rd -> Golf Course Rd\r\nSouthern Suburbs, Cape Town\r\n\r\nENTRY:\r\nR60 — Non-members\r\nR50 — Members/Pensioners/Students\r\n\r\nPAYMENT:\r\nFor ENTRY — Cash or Card\r\nFor FOOD & DRINKS — Card ONLY', '2025-11-03 00:00:00', '18:30:00', 60.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4801_keira_witherkay___rondebosch_golf_club_3_nov_2025-11-03/poster/Np4PvAl60BgYsUpSLMqSJqfLOyDfLXfc0YmLvIs7.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4801_keira_witherkay___rondebosch_golf_club_3_nov_2025-11-03\\/gallery\\/g3V0FZOOOBW1TuggdpYFwjIv9FpX0sJqX6JPp8pP.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 471, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-30 16:19:28', '2025-10-30 16:19:28'),
