(517, 'Anything can happen with Jason Hartman and ffs @ Jozi\'s Showbar', 'So Thursdays are our little slice of heaven where we get to rehearse, hang, catch up and do our thing at Jozi\'s Showbar. Its been affectionately named \"anything can happen Thursdays\" cos... well.. ya know...\r\nA couple weeks back our homie, Jason Hartman reached out and asked if we were keen to do a thing, to which we replied HELLS YEAH!\r\nWe decided to make a bit of a thing of it and put a sneaky show together on Anything can happen Thursday, and bring our other homies, Ffs! along for the ride.\r\nSo put on your dancing shoes, put a glass of water and 2 Compral on your nightstand, then pull in and say howdy. This one is undoubtedly gonna be a banger!\r\nSee ya there cats', '2025-11-06 00:00:00', '19:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2324_anything_can_happen_with_jason_hartman_and_ffs___jozis_showbar_2025-11-06/poster/y9RsKbPExkBIT6ihgI2CZvyjNenbvg5HnckuW760.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2324_anything_can_happen_with_jason_hartman_and_ffs___jozis_showbar_2025-11-06\\/gallery\\/rp2rUalQPk79mezwJZdjDSUpJjg3SId5rOnQqGHd.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 170, 'organiser', 5, '2025-10-31 16:25:44', '2025-10-31 16:32:52'),
