(587, 'Springboks Rugby @ Gilroy\'s Brewery 8 Nov', '🇿🇦 It’s Bokke Time at Gilroy’s! 🏉\r\n\r\nCatch Springboks vs France LIVE on the big screen this Saturday, 8 November at 22:10!\r\n\r\nBig hits. Big screens. Bigger beers. 🍻\r\n\r\n🔥 R80 for 2x Lagers – only when the Bokke play!\r\n\r\nGet in early, grab your seat, and bring the gees — there’s no better place to back the Bokke! 💚💛\r\n\r\n📍 5 Achter Rd, Rivonia Crossing\r\n☎️ 011 796 3020', '2025-11-08 00:00:00', '22:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9630_springboks_rugby___gilroy_s_brewery_8_nov_2025-11-08/poster/MrEcLrtj3RAJe6985LZTQhUUvZi0KSGExVXxs6lU.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9630_springboks_rugby___gilroy_s_brewery_8_nov_2025-11-08\\/gallery\\/Y2MqGSIzJpBZojdqCcy7G25AL8G6VD9iSJm4RAv6.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 47, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-04 17:57:35', '2025-11-04 17:57:35'),
(589, 'Craig Urbani @ Hogshead Douglasdale 7 Nov', 'Who needs a stage when Craig Urbani turns the whole pub into one? 🎤🔥\r\n\r\nHe’s live this Friday at Hogshead Douglasdale, serving powerhouse vocals and that feel-good Friday chaos we all secretly crave. Add flame-grilled favourites, drink specials, and a crowd that knows every word, and you’ve got a night you’ll be talking about at brunch. 😉🍔🍻\r\n\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Friday, 07 November 2025 from 20:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Douglasdale Village Shopping Centre c/o Leslie Avenue & Douglas Drive, Douglasdale', '2025-11-07 00:00:00', '20:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8805_craig_urbani___hogshead_douglasdale_7_nov_2025-11-07/poster/OfXb4ml8WgBZBAWLBVO2iY6fBRY2rNXRAcGM8kJJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8805_craig_urbani___hogshead_douglasdale_7_nov_2025-11-07\\/gallery\\/FE5ICmomAokU0WndxmqlVEBgpyRO6YWNahrRpfz1.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 31, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-04 22:24:43', '2025-11-04 22:24:43'),
