(615, 'Karen Zoid & Francois Van Coke @ Kirstenbosch Gardens 7 Dec', 'Expect fireworks as Afrikaans rock royalty Karen Zoid and Francois van Coke reunite to set the stage alight, marking 10 years of their smash hit Toe Vind Ek Jou. Both known for raw, high-octane performances, they’ll deliver a mix of their powerful duets alongside solo hits that fans know and love. This concert is about connection, energy and two iconic voices blending against the backdrop of Cape Town’s most iconic stage.\r\n\r\nGates open at 16:00 and music runs from 17:15 to 19:00.\r\n\r\nPack your picnic, gather your crew and prepare for explosive sounds and absolute star power.', '2025-12-07 00:00:00', '17:00:00', 255.00, 'https://www.webtickets.co.za/v2/event.aspx?itemid=1577100933', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1582_karen_zoid___francois_van_coke___kirstenbosch_gardens_7_dec_2025-12-07/poster/TdRyYBzmYLY6Dl1yazOy3MyLeiSlkT7SUEuH11RI.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1582_karen_zoid___francois_van_coke___kirstenbosch_gardens_7_dec_2025-12-07\\/gallery\\/kImZcfqpvpXzOv0M4G39ZCOSZ4FQwr7yAgNJKsFt.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 175, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-05 18:24:37', '2025-11-05 18:24:37'),
