(631, 'Matthew Mole in Carols by Candlelight @ Homestead Lake, Benoni 28-30 Nov', 'The wait is over… Carols by Candlelight is BACK! From 28 to 30 November 2025, Homestead Dam will come alive with the sound of music, the sparkle of Christmas lights, and families coming together to celebrate the most magical time of the year. Enjoy live performances, browse the festive market and treat yourself to delicious food from local food stalls. Hosted by Homestead Helpers, this special event will support Homestead Helpers, East Rand Palliative Care (Hospice), and the Benoni SPCA. Proudly Sponsored by Mannys Hardware Supplies, CMS (Community Monitoring Services), and Nitro-Med.\r\n\r\nSaxby Twins, Matthew Mole, Ross Learmonth, Refentse, Jo Black, Tree63, Piesangskille, Ndlovu Youth Choir, Rubber Duc, Jaryd Smith, Dr Victor & Rasta Rebels, Ivan Roux, Liam Black, Wildernis, String Quartet, Benoni Pipe Band, Brenties Primary School, Farrarmere Primary School, East Rand Palliative Care, DJ Luis Almeida, DJ Tavares, DJ Rix, DJ Miki', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '12:00:00', 80.00, 'https://computicket-boxoffice.com/e/carols-by-candlelight-friday-28-november-05z2iY', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8313_matthew_mole_in_carols_by_candlelight___homestead_lake__benoni_28_30_nov_2025-11-28/poster/hrZZjgGZFwVWFBdkX55sQfm2CGMYtvBbhRZlTj79.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8313_matthew_mole_in_carols_by_candlelight___homestead_lake__benoni_28_30_nov_2025-11-28\\/gallery\\/uaumnWiUqhIShag0OGNC743afOKu1ffNDVj5ZjKB.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 521, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-07 13:06:16', '2025-11-07 13:06:16'),
