(635, 'Mel Botes @ Fairtree Atterbury Theater 19 Nov', 'This intimate, unplugged concert strips away the layers, leaving only Mel, his guitar, and the sheer power of music. With masterful precision and soulful depth, he will reinterpret timeless classics by icons such as Bob Dylan, Leonard Cohen, JJ Cale, Eric Clapton, Carlos Santana, Pink Floyd, Dire Straits and more, while also showcasing his own acclaimed original works. The result is an evening of pure, unfiltered musicianship—both deeply personal and universally resonant.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to witness Mel Botes—unplugged, unfiltered, unforgettable!\r\n\r\nTickets are available on Seatme.co.za', '2025-11-19 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 250.00, 'https://www.seatme.co.za/tc-events/mel-botes-one-man-one-guitar/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8836_mel_botes___fairtree_atterbury_theater_19_nov_2025-11-19/poster/Yx2mdS0nCgAIWhA7NuAEsNv3bML6N1QbGqbKK85O.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8836_mel_botes___fairtree_atterbury_theater_19_nov_2025-11-19\\/gallery\\/mB09D9m5Xn3AwqUlaXLol2URHbQYxiQ66tuCdQjG.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 130, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-08 12:51:05', '2025-11-08 12:51:05'),
(637, 'Rone @ Hennie\'s Jolly Prawn 9 Nov', '☠️🏴‍☠️ Avast ye, mates! Saturday be a day o’ feasting and cheering! Join the crew for our mighty Espetada, and raise yer tankards high as we support our brave Bokkies with a sizzling Boerie Roll fit for a pirate king! ⚔️🔥\r\nThen on Sunday, the good winds be blowin’ in live tunes by the lovely Roné, while ye feast on our legendary Steak ‘n Prawn Combo! 🍤🥩🎶\r\n⚓ Bring yer mates, bring yer hearties — the weekend be callin’, and only the bold shall answer! 🏴‍☠️', '2025-11-09 00:00:00', '13:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4933_rone___hennies__jolly_prawn_9_nov_2025-11-09/poster/kMjvYWwrsSwRGDiTxj66CRlrg6ZCwAeNZO6PYE7t.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4933_rone___hennies__jolly_prawn_9_nov_2025-11-09\\/gallery\\/khPYWEnxmH8FBGTIq10ZRW1JF7GjqCZ2NJE94n08.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 5, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-09 12:35:54', '2025-11-09 12:37:34'),
