(640, 'Carols in the Park @ Lonehill Park 6 Dec', 'CAROLS IN THE PARK – brought to you by MTN National Wholesale, Saturday 6 December 2025, Lonehill Park.\r\nThe annual Lonehill Carols in the Park is brought to you by MTN National Wholesale and hosted by the Lonehill Residents Association.\r\nGates will open at 16h00 and the programme starts at 17h30 and will end at 20h30.\r\nEntertainment for the children includes Christmas Arts and Crafts, jumping castle, a visit from Father Christmas and his helpers with sweet treats.\r\nWe have food vendors selling light dinners, sweet treats and refreshments.\r\nTickets are R100 for adults and R80 for children between the age of 3 –13.\r\nTicket sales can be purchase ONLINE ONLY through Webtickets.\r\nPlease note that this event tends to sell out very quickly so please book your tickets soon to avoid disappointment as they are already selling quickly!\r\nVisitors should bring their picnic blankets and low chairs.\r\nGazebos are NOT allowed as they are a safety hazard and block the view of the stage for others.\r\nParking is available adjacent to the Lonehill Fire Station on Lonehill Boulevard only!\r\nREGRET NO DOGS.\r\nFor updates and information visit the Lonehill Residents Association Facebook page, webpage and Instagram or call the Lonehill Residents Association on (011) 465 9196', '2025-12-06 00:00:00', '16:00:00', 80.00, 'https://www.webtickets.co.za/v2/event.aspx?itemid=1580772178', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5928_carols_in_the_park___lonehill_park_6_dec_2025-12-06/poster/3qX4BdUHzzX8T8KBzLf5k6KSlS4kzuu7qWwaot4K.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5928_carols_in_the_park___lonehill_park_6_dec_2025-12-06\\/gallery\\/lmr3QuEP94kZbXWdXh5HkaVwj8iXJh0dhyOAckI5.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 524, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-10 19:23:11', '2025-11-10 19:23:11'),
