(718, 'Chicago\'s Summer Fest @ Chicago\'s Piano Bar 14 Dec', 'Chicago\'s\'SUMMER FEST 2025 is coming in hot.\r\n\r\nHot riffs, cold drinks and a Rock n Roll vibe that will set you up for summer like ever before.\r\n\r\nThis year we’re turning Chicago\'s Piano Bar - Randpark Ridge into a sizzling summer destination featuring Jozi’s hottest Rock & Roll acts with a lineup that’s stacked with loud-hearted legends and riot-ready newcomers.\r\n\r\nSay ‘Hi’ to:\r\nLunÆ Lane\r\nLater Alligator\r\nButch & The Lone Wolf\r\nRich Man Blue Band\r\n@Andre Kriel & Friends\r\n... and a true-to-tradition 80’s afterparty to wrap things up\r\n\r\nLoads of great drinks special (to be announced soon)\r\n\r\nDoors open at 12:00 – Jam kicks of at 13:00\r\nQuicket: R100\r\nDoor (on the day): R150\r\nCelebrate summer, celebrate life...', '2025-12-14 00:00:00', '12:00:00', 100.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/348463-chicagos-summer-fest-2025/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5224_chicago_s_summer_fest___chicago_s_piano_bar_14_dec_2025-12-14/poster/ejTLqEKCxH8KqJa2xQZRcMisUBkUAwHhav0LBUsa.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5224_chicago_s_summer_fest___chicago_s_piano_bar_14_dec_2025-12-14\\/gallery\\/r5NAWsXXSe6F2OfEGAJPiBrJ6D3UlLZuUfHY7bql.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 101, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-14 20:37:27', '2025-11-14 20:37:27'),
