(729, 'Cinema in That 80\'s Show', 'So Cinema will be doing our \"Spectacular 80s Show\" at Chicago\'s on Sunday afternoon the 30th of November.\r\n\r\nBe there its gonna rock people !! 🎶🎹🎤🎸🕺🎷🥁🎸🎵', '2025-11-30 00:00:00', '13:00:00', 100.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9560_cinema_in_that_80_s_show_2025-11-30/poster/BeeaBGfLfIg99yI7wK5O7lGelD3giYwKzPNkp9ee.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9560_cinema_in_that_80_s_show_2025-11-30\\/gallery\\/5aL0WYz1cZ0F4jOiDBfRAY5U1qsgZOLpblcq4cY8.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 101, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-15 12:44:01', '2025-11-15 12:44:01'),
