(776, 'The Flowstone Cocktail Crawl @ Rusty Feather Harties 14 Dec', 'We’re thrilled to announce that the Flowstone Cocktail Crawl will now take place on Sunday, 14 December — just in time for the festive season!\r\nGet ready for a one-of-a-kind 6km hike through Harties with 6 Flowstone cocktail tasters, breathtaking views, and the same good vibes you love.\r\n🎟️ Tickets are live — and moving fast!\r\nhttps://rustyfeather.co.za/cocktail-trail/ \r\nThis is a pre-entry event — we’re keeping numbers limited for the best experience. If it’s not sold out, a handful of tickets might be available at the door… but don’t risk it. Grab yours now and join the fun!\r\n📍 The Rusty Feather, Harties\r\n🌞 Sunday, 14 December | Registration 10:00 | Start 11:00–11:30\r\nPLUS — enjoy the Broederstroom Christmas Market at the home base with live music by Swerwer and free entry. 🎶✨', '2025-12-14 00:00:00', '10:00:00', 350.00, 'https://rustyfeather.co.za/cocktail-trail/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1018_the_flowstone_cocktail_crawl___rusty_feather_harties_14_dec_2025-12-14/poster/oIP3ufXvglMvTMdCdvbGeUYVhl7PO8LatJC8yfQN.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1018_the_flowstone_cocktail_crawl___rusty_feather_harties_14_dec_2025-12-14\\/gallery\\/sdCTDdYlhGcUm5k1O8Bdb7tKrjvAfllM4toifrUT.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 558, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-20 14:26:51', '2025-11-20 14:26:51'),
