(778, 'Roan Ash @ Kapstadt Brauhaus Langebaan 20 Nov', 'Here’s a couple of acoustic shows coming up next week at @kapstadtbrauhausdurbanville @kapstadtbrauhausstrand @kapstadtbrauhauslangebaan 🔥🔥🔥', '2025-11-20 00:00:00', '20:00:00', 200.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/332305-roan-ash-live-at-kapstadt-brauhaus-langebaan/?ref=events-list#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3314_roan_ash___kapstadt_brauhaus_langebaan_20_nov_2025-11-20/poster/DpfHEcnJPIucCEGrXM3yPnzB1vRs5T2moOSDmcwe.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3314_roan_ash___kapstadt_brauhaus_langebaan_20_nov_2025-11-20\\/gallery\\/nHzM1iSkoCPQyfs4bI1C13z0dGCxpO8CZHzv2krT.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 560, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-20 14:56:44', '2025-11-20 14:56:44'),
(779, 'Vinyl  Fair @ Capital Craft, Menlyn 7 Dec', 'Spin into a world of sonic wonders at the Menlo Vinyl Record Fair!\r\nWhere the beats are as crisp as a fresh needle drop and the vibes are smoother than a well-loved LP. From rare gems to chart-topping classics, the Vinyl Record Fair is a treasure trove for music lovers, collectors, and audiophiles alike.\r\nWhat to expect:\r\n🆒 Free entry\r\n🆒 4 Vinyl Dealers\r\n🆒 Live Vinyl DJ Sets\r\n🆒 The Best Vinyl Prices\r\n🆒 Record Cleaning Equipment\r\n🆒 Music Memorabilia\r\n🆒 The Best Craft Beer\r\n🆒 Great Food & Service\r\n🆒 FUN & BEER!\r\nWhatsApp 081 877 6924 to book your table!', '2025-12-07 00:00:00', '10:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4495_vinyl__fair___capital_craft__menlyn_7_dec_2025-12-07/poster/LWavE2Sjp6bzwEUGqPyJNw2Npgd5VyAsZUXllPuJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4495_vinyl__fair___capital_craft__menlyn_7_dec_2025-12-07\\/gallery\\/0GL7wC1xzUfkPGlf4AHMKXlxcl9Zq884anl8tSwe.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 93, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-20 16:04:12', '2025-11-20 16:04:12'),
(781, 'Speedo Fest @ Rusty Hook 29 Nov', 'In collaboration with Coden Entertainment, Speedo Fest is back for its 12th year! 📅 Date: 29 November 2025 📍 Venue: Rusty Hook, Honeydew Charity: Woodrock Animal Rescue Lineup: To be announced EVENT LINEUP: – The Dookies – The Barcode Bandits – Amber Light Choices – Pennydrop – The Color Blew – Eutony – LunÆ Lane – Rich Man Blue – The Named Speedo Fest is a charity festival, with all proceeds donated to the selected cause.', '2025-11-29 00:00:00', '10:00:00', 80.00, 'https://perceptionsa.co.za/speedo-fest-12/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4792_speedo_fest___rusty_hook_29_nov_2025-11-29/poster/u8rduT3omqjFR4ll0XylEN4asajrE3YL5hn3FvBn.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4792_speedo_fest___rusty_hook_29_nov_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/hLoQAInNYmbNXBCTuvmMmkBuom4oJvDJvPEr5Py5.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4792_speedo_fest___rusty_hook_29_nov_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/kuDoqCn9SBi1flbcTAAJW4yVENogcUOFQ3m8f2av.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4792_speedo_fest___rusty_hook_29_nov_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/sDbSq95wF3VfvW8XVVp3Y947bTZQrlX5CF6iCnrD.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4792_speedo_fest___rusty_hook_29_nov_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/jIoJ3LGAIYrXwjTJSng702ZYSzSZytaBxjfwpPuj.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 241, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-20 16:33:30', '2025-11-20 16:33:30'),
(782, 'Anton Van Rooyen @ Hogshead Rock Cottage 21 Nov', 'Friday called, it wants an awesome soundtrack, and Anton van Rooyen is delivering it live at Hogshead Rock Cottage. 🎸⚡ Expect feel-good tunes, proper pub flavour, and drink specials that make sticking around feel like the smartest decision of the week. 🍔🍻\r\n\r\n🗓️ 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗡: Friday, 21 November 2025 from 20:00\r\n📍 𝗪𝗛𝗘𝗥𝗘: Rock Cottage Shopping Centre, c/o John Vorster & Christiaan de Wet Road, Weltevredenpark\r\n— at Hogshead Rock Cottage.', '2025-11-21 00:00:00', '20:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2757_anton_van_rooyen___hogshead_rock_cottage_21_nov_2025-11-21/poster/fJh9jkdWUg1YqW8jOXEd5EuaA98AYGikwkLKCEOZ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2757_anton_van_rooyen___hogshead_rock_cottage_21_nov_2025-11-21\\/gallery\\/5WpKODLxnOr0EmvLjxb3wwO9Ui6xXWKGrIwV3uIW.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 55, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-20 17:19:55', '2025-11-20 17:19:55'),
