(784, 'Dewald Steyn at Bustop', '🎶 LIVE MUSIC WEEKEND AT BUSSTOP7! 🎶\r\nNothing beats great food, sunshine and live performances to set the mood for a perfect weekend! 😍🌞\r\n📌 Saturday 22 Nov – Dewald Steyn\r\n🕚 11:00 & 12:30\r\nGet ready for feel-good hits and the best sing-along vibes 🎤✨\r\n📌 Sunday 23 Nov – Marius Dippenaar\r\n🕚 11:00 & 12:30\r\nBring the family, grab something delicious to eat and enjoy top-class entertainment under the blue umbrellas 💙\r\n💸 Entrance R25 pp | Kids under 12 FREE\r\n📍 Busstop7 Open Air Market – Pretoria East\r\nCome early, grab your seats, soak up the atmosphere and let’s make it an unforgettable music weekend 🎵🍹', '2025-11-22 00:00:00', '11:00:00', 25.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1523_dewald_steyn_at_bustop_2025-11-22/poster/5Ttk5MTWsLGrPFybQDdGWYDOsfaHpKGesscmEPfN.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1523_dewald_steyn_at_bustop_2025-11-22\\/gallery\\/45Xn51zC8EB8M3KTXjdjnQzE5SXh6d9p167eoTHb.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 91, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 14:13:57', '2025-11-21 14:13:57'),
