(786, 'Springboks v Ireland Live @ Gilroy\'s Brewery 22 Nov', 'Catch Springboks vs Ireland LIVE on the big screen this Saturday, 22 November at 19:40!\r\n\r\nBig hits. Big screens. Bigger beers. 🍻\r\n\r\n🔥 R80 for 2x Lagers – only when the Bokke play!\r\n\r\nGet in early, grab your seat, and bring the gees — there’s no better place to back the Bokke! 💚💛\r\n\r\n📍 5 Achter Rd, Rivonia Crossing\r\n☎️ 011 796 3020', '2025-11-22 00:00:00', '19:40:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1873_springboks_v_ireland_live___gilroy_s_brewery_22_nov_2025-11-22/poster/2eCbN2HGf1F4qJv3OQOH8aAljDCHi5LRPIJqK4QW.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1873_springboks_v_ireland_live___gilroy_s_brewery_22_nov_2025-11-22\\/gallery\\/XSndsdwrQeVoLKVc4wiACWZrEcYGTnRqk4WcXiLp.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 47, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 14:20:19', '2025-11-21 14:20:19'),
(787, 'The West Coast’s Favourite Summer Music Festival is Back! 🌞🌅', 'Gather your crew, pack your picnic blankets, and get ready for an unforgettable day out as Get Lucky Summer brings our second edition of the ultimate family-friendly music festival to the Table View Primary School Fields.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis is how the West Coast does summer: great vibes, sunshine, ice-cold drinks, delicious food trucks, your best friends and your favourite South African artists taking you from golden afternoon into a magical sunset session.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFollow FlySafair Get Lucky Summer for announcements.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\n\r\nGet Lucky Summer West Coast is not just a concert – it’s the perfect summer day out for everyone:\r\n\r\n✨ Arrive early, set up your picnic spot and soak up the summer sunshine.\r\n\r\n✨ Sing and dance to live performances from SA’s top artists as the sun sets over the West Coast.\r\n\r\n✨ Treat yourself to gourmet food trucks, coffee stalls, and an ice-cold beer garden.\r\n\r\n✨ Relax in a safe, family-friendly space with loads of room to dance, play and chill.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLINE-UP 🎶\r\nGOODLUCK\r\n\r\nTHE PARLOTONES\r\n\r\nBEN RODRIGUES\r\n\r\nMAJOZI\r\n\r\n& DJS TBA\r\n\r\n\r\nEVENT DETAILS\r\n📍 Table View Primary School Sports Fields\r\n\r\n📅 Saturday, 13 December 2025\r\n\r\n⏰ Gates open 14:00 | Music until 21:30\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStage times will be released closer to the date – follow our socials for updates!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTICKETS 🎟️\r\nBOOK NOW\r\n\r\nGENERAL:\r\n\r\n👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Family of 4 (discount): R220\r\n\r\n🐦 Early Bird: R250\r\n\r\n🎟️ Phase 2: R295\r\n\r\n🔥 Final Phase: R385\r\n\r\n👶 Kids U12: R160\r\n\r\n👶 Babies U2: FREE\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFOOD & DRINKS\r\nWe’ve got an epic line-up of gourmet food trucks, barista coffee stands, and an ice-cold summer bar so you can stay fuelled all afternoon. (No alcohol may be brought in.)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPARKING\r\nOn-site parking available, but we recommend carpooling or rideshares for the smoothest arrival.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSAFETY\r\nAll ages welcome! Anyone under 18 will receive a separate accreditation. IDs may be requested at the gate.', '2025-12-13 00:00:00', '14:00:00', 220.00, 'https://www.howler.co.za/events/get-lucky-summer-tableview-primary-fields-ct-ft-goodluck-the-parlotones-ben-rodrigues-majozi-3f1c', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2200_the_west_coast___s_favourite_summer_music_festival_is_back___________2025-12-13/poster/3UGlUSTn9KwRiGTnVS8ZVGZc6DlQV5l1oAvmNGPB.png', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2200_the_west_coast___s_favourite_summer_music_festival_is_back___________2025-12-13\\/gallery\\/EZDw8Rv3YVXtFIKSShf9xUeog3S75t0LkOvoxrAO.png\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 561, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 17:27:53', '2025-11-21 17:27:53'),
(788, 'Parlotones @ Crawfords Beach Lodge 16 & 17 December 2025', 'The Parlatones will be live at Crawfords Beach Lodge \r\n\r\non 16th & the 17th December 2025 (separate shows)\r\n\r\nDoors Open at 5pm - Main show at 8pm', '2025-12-17 00:00:00', '17:00:00', 150.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/296416-parlatones-crawfords-beach-lodge-16-december-2025/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_3445_parlotones___crawfords_beach_lodge_16___17_december_2025_2025-12-17/poster/BesYI3DXr9FJg6QKQ0DDXJ9QBBurSFKWea4gAddJ.png', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_3445_parlotones___crawfords_beach_lodge_16___17_december_2025_2025-12-17\\/gallery\\/Qm9fbHN34QD1o99GS6YIfuKPqMGLHz30xkZhS2z0.png\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 562, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 17:30:26', '2025-11-21 17:30:26'),
(789, 'The Parlotones Live @ Stanford Hills Estate', 'Join us for a fun day out for the family as the sun sets over one of South Africa\'s picturesque venues, where the magic of your favorite South African music comes to life.\r\n\r\nThe Parlotones have left an indelible mark on the South African music scene. Their journey from humble beginnings to international success showcases their talent, dedication, and passion for music. Whether you’re a fan of indie rock or simply appreciate great melodies, The Parlotones continue to inspire listeners around the world.', '2025-12-14 00:00:00', '15:00:00', 310.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/347204-the-parlotones-live-at-stanford-hills-estate/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5019_the_parlotones_live___stanford_hills_estate_2025-12-14/poster/uRAcEb2pSFpsUwfn8n77Ace4SJWKqLxqlQxiYWGL.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5019_the_parlotones_live___stanford_hills_estate_2025-12-14\\/gallery\\/7x4YeL3IsvwHd04Ix6O1x5iK75Lg4YZT2I2PHNHD.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 563, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 17:33:09', '2025-11-21 17:33:09'),
(790, 'The Parlotones @ St Francis Brewery', 'GREEN AREA: DANCEFLOOR AND TREE BAR AREA. SKIP THE QUEUE, PRE-ORDER YOUR MEAL WITH YOUR TICKET SELECTION. FIRST COME FIRST SERVE FOR SEATING. \r\n\r\n3 BARS & STREET FOOD MENU. ROVING WAITER SERVICE. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGOLD SEATS: VIP 5 OR 7- SEATER TABLES INCLUDE DINNER PLATTERS, CHAMPAGNE AND TABLE SERVICE.\r\n\r\nBLUE SEATS: BAR AREA SEATING WITH TABLE SERVICE. MOVE TO THE DANCEFLOOR FOR THE SHOW.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Parlotones are a renowned South African indie rock band hailing from Johannesburg, formed in 1998. The ensemble features Kahn Morbee on vocals and rhythm guitar, Paul Hodgson as lead guitarist, Glen Hodgson handling bass guitar, keyboards, and backing vocals, and Neil Pauw on drums and percussion.[1] Originally rooted in Britpop, The Parlotones\' music has evolved to encompass a diverse range of genres, with lyrics centered on relatable themes such as love and everyday life, complemented by engaging and memorable melodies.', '2025-12-18 00:00:00', '19:30:00', 310.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/345719-the-parlotones-st-francis-brewery/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6246_the_parlotones___st_francis_brewery_2025-12-18/poster/fHU0j18uJyRz0quiHqjxMTx93zmLIBtOrRybKg4D.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6246_the_parlotones___st_francis_brewery_2025-12-18\\/gallery\\/T7eNCL5PG70Uk0YjAdW2Qli12eMIA1oFy41IdJ8A.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 564, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 17:36:27', '2025-11-21 17:36:27'),
(791, 'The Parlotones Live @ Shabby Fuffu – Plettenberg Bay! 20 Dec', 'They’re back and it’s going to be bigger than ever!\r\nJoin us for a spectacular summer evening on Sat, 20 December, as The Parlotones return to Plettenberg Bay for another unforgettable live performance at Shabby Fuffu.\r\n\r\n\r\nHaving played to sold-out crowds in Plett before, The Parlotones have become firm local favourites, known for delivering electrifying shows filled with passion, connection, and the timeless hits that made them one of South Africa’s most loved rock bands. From “Push Me to the Floor” and “Giant Mistake” to “I’ll Be There” and “Beautiful,” their setlist promises to have you singing along all night!\r\n\r\n\r\nBring your friends, your family, and your festive spirit for an evening of great music, great food, and great company in the heart of Plett’s summer season. Delicious food and drinks will be available on-site the perfect way to enjoy an easy, relaxing evening under the stars.\r\n\r\n\r\nDate: Sat, 20 December\r\nVenue: Shabby Fuffu, Plettenberg Bay\r\nGates Open: 5:00 PM\r\nShow starts: 7:00 PM\r\nTickets: R300 per person / R350 at the door / Kids under 14 - R150', '2025-12-20 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 300.00, 'https://tickets.tixsa.co.za/event/the-parlotones-live-in-plett', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7757_the_parlotones_live___shabby_fuffu_____plettenberg_bay__20_dec_2025-12-20/poster/cLumUQcySA36VEYfLPswIzbUzhKrV4uQFp5FhjRU.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7757_the_parlotones_live___shabby_fuffu_____plettenberg_bay__20_dec_2025-12-20\\/gallery\\/BITCpMpenB1enQqdUUubZ55djhgIDSQHA16At5rC.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 565, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 17:38:45', '2025-11-21 17:38:45'),
(792, 'Smelt @ Jan Se Skuld 21 Nov', 'Smelt @ Jan Se Skuld 21 Nov', '2025-11-21 00:00:00', '18:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7457_smelt___jan_se_skuld_21_nov_2025-11-21/poster/TsbEiLLYMFOjNPS3MADGFkLJ0wS6TwHxMTQrXtTT.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7457_smelt___jan_se_skuld_21_nov_2025-11-21\\/gallery\\/22jyG0MNqPqtmmPDTrv7yT4QdsIBCmu7Ceh3MmoM.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 167, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 18:04:06', '2025-11-21 18:04:06'),
(793, 'Hilton Crest @ Jan se Skuld 22 Nov', 'Hilton Crest @ Jan se Skuld 22 Nov', '2025-11-22 00:00:00', '16:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5232_hilton_crest___jan_se_skuld_22_nov_2025-11-22/poster/9L3QKAaqNSj9VdeFpwQKXHpinisSj063UNtH7WZe.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5232_hilton_crest___jan_se_skuld_22_nov_2025-11-22\\/gallery\\/AEPwlaKQUsCEe5wY90s6bKkJWbSuvUTbPpBJITAX.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 167, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 18:09:37', '2025-11-21 18:09:37'),
(795, 'Will Jordan @ Jan Se skuld 23 Nov', 'Will Jordan @ Jan Se skuld 23 Nov', '2025-11-23 00:00:00', '13:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8383_will_jordan___jan_se_skuld_23_nov_2025-11-23/poster/mFGFxZX4KrpmHCYDtlqZeGV7jkNwDCPSHturf3OK.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8383_will_jordan___jan_se_skuld_23_nov_2025-11-23\\/gallery\\/RaBDsTTi0O2ZEkwxaiF1pvSMheecUFju1RfNeqKv.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 167, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 18:15:18', '2025-11-21 18:15:18'),
(796, 'Rich Man Blue in Silver Fox Sunday Sessions  @ Padlangs 30 Nov', 'Playing some cool tunes at Padlangs on the 30th November - show starts at 12:30.\r\nI am doing a few new solo blues tracks with some live looping then I will get the Rich Man Blue Band for a killer afternoon set.\r\nEntrance is free and the sunday vibe at the restaurant is 🤩 (Pretoria fans really appreciate music)🎶\r\nRichard Ingham\r\n#bluesguitarist', '2025-11-30 00:00:00', '12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9671_rich_man_blue_in_silver_fox_sunday_sessions____padlangs_30_nov_2025-11-30/poster/9jsuVWvOwJBRctw5Hjs5fAU8DZ0oeAyLQO1QnUpE.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9671_rich_man_blue_in_silver_fox_sunday_sessions____padlangs_30_nov_2025-11-30\\/gallery\\/F1SGTSn0W3SIUaRkRPb52baA7h6EfjK21mba1Z72.jpg\",\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9671_rich_man_blue_in_silver_fox_sunday_sessions____padlangs_30_nov_2025-11-30\\/gallery\\/n7uEudXpljlOfmRG2Tq5NdRplcjQ0RpEPZWoMK5P.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 406, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-21 19:26:53', '2025-11-21 19:26:53'),
(797, 'Artist test event', 'Artist test event', '2025-11-22 00:00:00', '06:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'artists/art_davesignup_6254/events/event_3125_artist_test_event_2025-11-22/poster/ralqxWyTg64GSY4lepxRa1lPX1G4wBOMRPzJ1s7K.jpg', NULL, 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 14, 'artist', 75, '2025-11-21 19:52:51', '2025-11-21 19:52:51'),
(803, 'Marmalade On Toast — Sasha Taylor\'s EP Launch Party 29 Nov', 'Join us for a sun-soaked afternoon of music, food, and community vibes at Marmalade On Toast — the official launch party for Sasha Taylor’s debut EP, Marmalade.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKicking off in the afternoon, this family-friendly event features live sets from Sasha Taylor alongside a lineup of incredible local artists, all bringing their unique sounds to the stage. Think soulful tunes, indie grooves, and warm melodies to ease you into the evening.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThere’ll be delicious food, drinks available, and plenty of space for kids and grown-ups alike to soak up the good energy. As the sun goes down, we turn up — with a DJ after-party to keep the celebration going.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCome raise a toast to Marmalade, discover fresh local sounds, and be part of a beautiful day of music and connection.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDRESS CODE: Marmalade vibes encouraged — think orange, golden tones, citrus flair, or just your best toast-worthy look...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* Free entry for kids under 12', '2025-11-29 00:00:00', '14:00:00', 70.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/339723-marmalade-on-toast/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_5851_marmalade_on_toast_____sasha_taylor_s_ep_launch_party_29_nov_2025-11-29/poster/pmhu9LELS9a7tcbZJLZ2AcQg8ljSFi521XCzHvfG.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_5851_marmalade_on_toast_____sasha_taylor_s_ep_launch_party_29_nov_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/obsrPwiK2tYvjxybEG9X6lJZm1JbCAQWPHrvdR8L.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 568, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-24 15:08:24', '2025-11-24 15:08:24'),
(804, 'Pagan Freedom Day @ Rusty Hook 26 April 2026', '🌿✨ 𝗣𝗮𝗴𝗮𝗻 𝗙𝗿𝗲𝗲𝗱𝗼𝗺 𝗗𝗮𝘆 𝟮𝟬𝟮𝟲 🌞🎉\r\n𝗥𝘂𝘀𝘁𝘆 𝗛𝗼𝗼𝗸, 𝗛𝗼𝗻𝗲𝘆𝗱𝗲𝘄 | 𝗦𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗮𝘆 𝟮𝟲 𝗔𝗽𝗿𝗶𝗹\r\n𝘛𝘩𝘦 𝘯𝘦𝘹𝘵 𝘥𝘢𝘺’𝘴 𝘢 𝘱𝘶𝘣𝘭𝘪𝘤 𝘩𝘰𝘭𝘪𝘥𝘢𝘺! 😉\r\n🧙‍♀️🌳 Join us for an enchanting day of fun, freedom, and community as we celebrate our connection to the Earth and each other! Whether you\'re a seasoned pagan or just here for the vibes, there\'s something for everyone at Pagan Freedom Day!\r\n🐾Socialised pets on lead welcome | 🚗Parking R30 per vehicle, cash only\r\n🎟️ 𝗚𝗘𝗧 𝗧𝗜𝗖𝗞𝗘𝗧𝗦: R10 - R60 on https://qkt.io/pfd2026\r\n🌟 𝗙𝗥𝗘𝗘 𝗔𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗩𝗜𝗧𝗜𝗘𝗦:\r\n🥁 Feel the rhythm in the drumming circles\r\n👗 Get creative with the Best Dressed Parade (with prizes, of course!)\r\n✨ Participate in the Protection Circle\r\n😄 Have some fun with beer pong and other (more family-friendly) games\r\n🎟️ 𝗘𝗫𝗧𝗥𝗔 𝗠𝗔𝗚𝗜𝗖 - Prebook your spot on https://www.alternatribe.co.za/pagan-freedom-day-2026.../ for:\r\n🌸 Make Your Own Flower Crown – weave your magic into every petal!\r\n🎃 Pan’s Pumpkin Hunt (who knows what treasures you’ll find?)\r\nᚠ Intro to Runes Workshop – discover the mysteries of the Elder Futhark\r\n🔮 Crossings Over (because who doesn’t love a mystical journey?)\r\n🧙‍♀️ Hocus Pocus Pouch Scavenger Hunt – create your own charm\r\n🌿 Make Your Own Smudge Stick Workshop – cleanse your space with power and intention\r\n💃 Beginner Bellydance Workshop\r\n🔥 𝗔𝗧𝗧𝗥𝗔𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡𝗦 𝗜𝗡𝗖𝗟𝗨𝗗𝗘:\r\n🎟️A One-Winner-Takes-All Raffle with prizes valued at over R5000\r\n💃Captivating bellydancers to mesmerize you\r\n🌱Delicious food & drinks, with plenty of vegan options\r\n👑 Join the Best Dressed Parade\r\n🍺 Free to play Beer Pong all day\r\n... and more surprises on the day!\r\n🧙‍♂️🌿Come one, come all, and let’s make this Pagan Freedom Day the most magical one yet!\r\nIt’s going to be an enchanting day - don’t miss out!', '2026-04-26 00:00:00', '10:00:00', 10.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/350010-pagan-freedom-day-jhb-2026/?ref=events-list#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_9306_pagan_freedom_day___rusty_hook_26_april_2026_2026-04-26/poster/THLL7CmLKWkMx0bcQVjJHjklDouGZI0BKKXfLjcZ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_9306_pagan_freedom_day___rusty_hook_26_april_2026_2026-04-26\\/gallery\\/NYgc7n3X5bgrs1rIm1GBCT2zXz6K4tx1E5yJIIbM.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 241, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-24 17:15:37', '2025-11-24 17:18:18'),
(805, 'Blue Rock @ Urban Oasis 28 Nov', 'Blue Rock @ Urban Oasis 28 Nov', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '19:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1892_blue_rock___urban_oasis_28_nov_2025-11-28/poster/LTvnoPVEJuVkKdF99kv5lu1S3eWgT9iE4jC1Rh6G.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1892_blue_rock___urban_oasis_28_nov_2025-11-28\\/gallery\\/r3Ak40wU7qI2sAYlKjZOaJw26upojOFSyDsdOqWP.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 21, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 14:31:12', '2025-11-25 14:31:12'),
(806, 'The Two Timers @ Fu-Bar 27 Nov', '🎶 Step into our weekly line-up of excitement! 🎶\r\n\r\nDive into the Thursday Klipdrift Sessions (Thursday, 27 November 2025)\r\n\r\nEnjoy live music, mouth-watering dishes, and an electrifying atmosphere that promises a blend of flavours, melodies, and sheer delight! 🎉🍽🎸\r\n\r\nLocation: 33 Troupant Avenue, Magaliesburg, Sandton, Gauteng 2067\r\n\r\nCall us on 011 463 3847 to book a table', '2025-11-27 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8963_the_two_timers___fu_bar_27_nov_2025-11-27/poster/ahtbcgyY7cxHgttPlJVTCdtqwY93lYieGCgZIUPU.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8963_the_two_timers___fu_bar_27_nov_2025-11-27\\/gallery\\/gIPXco0g6MEgnivWasQLZis9OHbAqUS3cCuUQUOI.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 43, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 18:46:43', '2025-11-25 18:46:43'),
(807, 'Black Cat Bones and Later Alligator @ Railways Irene 30 Nov', 'Another week of Railways Shenanigans is in full swing. 🔥\r\n\r\nTuesday kicks off with Tune 4 Tune, Quiz Night sparks the midweek vibes, and Thursday serves half-price pizza with Kaalwoorde’s open mic setting the tone. Friday comes alive with BLVD HVNNY: The Awakening, while Saturday blends Vinyl Market energy, live sets, SA vs Wales on the big screen, and DJ Neps keeping the pulse high.\r\n\r\nTheatre goes next-level with a metal lineup hosted by France The Planet, and Sunday eases into Alt Market, Later Alligator, and The Black Cat Bones, the perfect way to catch your breath and soak in the week.\r\n\r\nGood vibes, full hearts, and a week well spent. ⚡️', '2025-11-30 00:00:00', '13:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8451_black_cat_bones_and_later_alligator___railways_irene_30_nov_2025-11-30/poster/UTkLpp511fjrIKpq8Siw0hDnSq7C33RnEBaS5xHJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8451_black_cat_bones_and_later_alligator___railways_irene_30_nov_2025-11-30\\/gallery\\/Loq3fhmrWXMp9FTvNVEccA6utxdXAsdB2JH2pCPX.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 228, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 18:57:05', '2025-11-25 18:57:05'),
(809, 'Connor Rhys @ Gilroy\'s Brewery 27 Nov', 'Thursday, 27 November – Connor Rhys | 5–9PM\r\n🎶 Ease into the weekend early with Connor Rhys live at Gilroy’s!\r\nCold beers, great tunes, and that unbeatable Thursday vibe. 🍻🎸\r\n📍 5 Achter Rd, Rivonia Crossing\r\n☎️ 011 796 3020', '2025-11-27 00:00:00', '17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4338_connor_rhys___gilroy_s_brewery_27_nov_2025-11-27/poster/eWEZYYm9S1czkGZGuJuSUlwGup7iR5Rt20zRSoDc.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4338_connor_rhys___gilroy_s_brewery_27_nov_2025-11-27\\/gallery\\/AB93E4a5xm3G23OjY6nThxbuQLNJVunXZZyJW4UG.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 47, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 19:16:13', '2025-11-25 19:16:13');
