(810, 'JAN JAN JAN @ Silverstar 28 Feb', 'Die gewilde Afrikaanse partytjiegroep JAN JAN JAN is terug met nog ’n absolute treffer wat gereed is om elke braaivleisvuur, sokkie en partytjie aan die gang te sit. Hul splinternuwe enkelsnit, Liefde In \'n Loopdop, is ’n viering van alles wat ons kultuur op sy lekkerste maak – liefde, kuier, en natuurlik, ’n goeie loopdop!', '2026-02-28 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 220.00, 'https://www.barnyardtheatre.co.za/show.aspx?sid=1280&vid=22', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_6634_jan_jan_jan___silverstar_28_feb_2026-02-28/poster/7FNGoUlqbNuqqhICoYnhMe3M8UZ6QLnPKphU7cSw.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_6634_jan_jan_jan___silverstar_28_feb_2026-02-28\\/gallery\\/hWtgvtM3GYU7rZq8WcS7GkfzH974g1UP0LYWLxtf.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 269, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 19:24:28', '2025-11-25 19:24:28'),
(811, 'Praise the LOUD Fest @ Daisy Jones Bar 6 Dec', 'Cape Town, your time has come.\r\n\r\nYou’ve shouted. We’ve heard you. And now we’re bringing the noise straight to your doorstep.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPraise the LOUD Fest — South Africa’s new favourite rock congregation — is planting its boots in the vineyards of Stellenbosch at Daisy Jones Bar for one night only.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nForget polished. Forget polite. This is for the lifers, the lost, the loud — a lineup that cuts deep into the underbelly of SA rock history while lighting a match under the new school.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE LINEUP:\r\n\r\nThe Awakening\r\n\r\nSpringbok Nude Girls\r\n\r\nBOO! \r\n\r\nPLUM\r\n\r\nBLVD HVNNY\r\n\r\nMetro Villa\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThat’s goth. That’s alt. That’s ska, indie sleaze, and unfiltered electricity. All in one night. No fillers. No breaks. No second chances.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis isn’t a festival trying to be something.\r\n\r\nThis is something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n“Praise the LOUD – it’s not a genre, it’s a lifestyle.”\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThat’s not just a tagline. It’s a manifesto.\r\n\r\nWe’re building a stage where the ghosts of the 90s share sweat and feedback with tomorrow’s headliners. Where nostalgia punches through the present with a fistful of distortion. Where Daisy Jones becomes a pressure cooker of riffs, rage, and revelation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you’ve ever felt like the volume’s been turned down on the Cape Town scene — this is your reset.\r\n\r\nLouder. Grittier. Stranger. Realer.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNo sponsors telling you what to wear. No algorithms telling you what to like. Just a night of beautiful noise, soaked in beer, sweat, and that one bass note that hits you right in the ribs.', '2025-12-06 00:00:00', '16:00:00', 220.00, 'https://www.quicket.co.za/events/335895-praise-the-loud-fest-cpt-edition/#/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_2719_praise_the_loud_fest___daisy_jones_bar_6_dec_2025-12-06/poster/z9Ob0MzSiJJHUtMfT4315WZiY08VmyAeHfXszqaM.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_2719_praise_the_loud_fest___daisy_jones_bar_6_dec_2025-12-06\\/gallery\\/zIGt9rsUmdvA5PjB6GvdJIP2fjdEiMLs6wI8HlGZ.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 404, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-25 22:23:58', '2025-11-25 22:23:58'),
