(819, 'Santa’s sleigh is stopping at Country Pub! 🎄✨ 16 Dec', 'Santa’s sleigh is stopping at Country Pub! 🎄✨\r\nBring the family, enjoy a festive roast, live tunes, face painting AND meet Santa!\r\nDon’t forget a gift to support our charity drive ❤️🎁\r\n-LIVE BAND\r\n-FACE PAINTING FOR THE KIDS\r\n-DOG AND KID FRIENDLY VENUE\r\n-ROAST\r\nTUESDAY 16 December 2026 – Starts 12PM\r\nTO BOOK CALL 010 786 1109', '2025-12-16 00:00:00', '12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7118_santa___s_sleigh_is_stopping_at_country_pub__________16_dec_2025-12-16/poster/xqC5q5qRXxcEb1Y1y6K6yKvxbuK8LosDbxiMstZC.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7118_santa___s_sleigh_is_stopping_at_country_pub__________16_dec_2025-12-16\\/gallery\\/DgHlvJXD8pLJ2b56cHp0iRuAqcxv8DViZEFEdiv5.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 178, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-26 12:42:26', '2025-11-26 12:42:26'),
(820, 'Frontline @ Sheena\'s 28 Nov', 'The legendary FRONTLINE BAND, playing live this Friday from 6pm – 9pm!\r\nCome for the tunes, stay for the vibes - and don’t forget your dancing shoes because these guys know how to bring the party! 💃🕺\r\n📲 Table Bookings: 084 519 6750\r\n🚫 No Under 18', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '18:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8376_frontline___sheena_s_28_nov_2025-11-28/poster/5RcIDgat7gRYk3LyWz2Wv0ZvBt4ScFY5ZwUqV1tc.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8376_frontline___sheena_s_28_nov_2025-11-28\\/gallery\\/un7m0zbPVByKdeYnvfJr1EgbvvJhN9MlVDuISYj6.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 247, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-26 12:44:24', '2025-11-26 12:44:24'),
(821, 'Roan Ash @ Fairtree Theater 10 - 11 Dec', 'Join Roan Ash for an unforgettable night as he unveils his new EP, Thieves — a raw, soulful collection of songs about love, loss, and life. Blending heartfelt storytelling with his signature smoky vocals, Roan takes the stage with an intimate, cinematic performance that’ll stay with you long after the lights go down.', '2025-12-11 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 300.00, 'https://www.seatme.co.za/tc-events/roan-ash-thieves-2/', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_1186_roan_ash___fairtree_theater_10___11_dec_2025-12-11/poster/UGM1wON0PE0qWV1DkTxRVybXQqhmBteyYcTH13sJ.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_1186_roan_ash___fairtree_theater_10___11_dec_2025-12-11\\/gallery\\/znFAYYjqv4PXnocvP4MDgxV93IsOFYvLcZ98cFxW.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 130, 'user', 22, '2025-11-26 13:08:26', '2025-11-26 13:10:31'),
(822, 'Bok van Blerk @ The Stables, Stilbaai 22 Dec', 'Kom geniet \'n heerlike kuier by The Stables in Stilbaai met ‘n onvergeetlike vertoning deur Bok van Blerk en sy orkes.\r\nOngereserveerde sitplekke\r\nBring jou kampstoel of kombers vir sitplekke op die gras\r\nGeen eie drinkgoed mag gebring word nie\r\nGeen wapens\r\nGeen sambrele of gazebos\r\n\r\nVir enige navrae kontak die venue direk – Annemarie 076 073 3694', '2025-12-22 00:00:00', '18:00:00', 280.00, 'https://itickets.co.za/register/new/484953', 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4844_bok_van_blerk___the_stables__stilbaai_22_dec_2025-12-22/poster/MbDQcvfesmAcfZLBt5zA521uft5wvnHb9c5PDc6q.png', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4844_bok_van_blerk___the_stables__stilbaai_22_dec_2025-12-22\\/gallery\\/8SmEfceqMCXnJrbDZKTYe2siKQk9UCvNhwxDKEzb.png\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 572, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-26 13:30:19', '2025-11-26 13:30:19'),
(823, 'Vegan Hippie Connection Market Jhb @ Pirates Club 30 Nov', '𝗝𝗼𝗶𝗻 us again 𝗦𝘂𝗻𝗱𝗮𝘆 - 30 November 💚 month’s theme - Kind & Local Market at\r\n📍 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗿𝗲: Pirates Sports Club,\r\n25 Breaside Road, Greenside / Parkhurst\r\n⏰ 𝟵𝗮𝗺 𝘁𝗼 𝟯𝗽𝗺\r\n🎫 FREE Entry\r\n𝟭𝟬𝟬% 𝗩𝗲𝗴𝗮𝗻 Market - Come delight in 𝗽𝗹𝗮𝗻𝘁-𝗯𝗮𝘀𝗲𝗱 deliciousness all around and get to meet up with #local artists | pre-loved Thrift 𝗙𝗮𝘀𝗵𝗶𝗼𝗻 | extraordinary Animal Welfare Organisations | Unique Creators & Makers and their love filled creations.', '2025-11-30 00:00:00', '10:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_4075_vegan_hippie_connection_market_jhb___pirates_club_30_nov_2025-11-30/poster/kjH88LKD66Pxgf7JMg4GRUAdKRMLUEPLdRdF76iC.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_4075_vegan_hippie_connection_market_jhb___pirates_club_30_nov_2025-11-30\\/gallery\\/8t6SQroXQxdwG8PqDIE5C2ShVs6wWaGlF1BC8UlZ.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 488, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-26 14:34:57', '2025-11-26 14:34:57'),
(824, 'Dee Dewald @ Hogshead Rock Cottage 28 Nov', 'Weekend vibes incoming! 3 shows lined up — let’s make it a big one 🎶🔥\r\n\r\n🔥 Fri 28 Nov – Hogshead Rock Cottage – 8 PM\r\n📍 Rock Cottage Shopping Centre, John Vorster Rd, Weltevredenpark\r\n\r\n🌿 Sat 29 Nov – Fourways Gardens Residential Estate – 4 PM\r\n📍 Private Estate Event (Residents Only)\r\n\r\n🔒 Sun 30 Nov – Private Event\r\n📍 Johannesburg (Private booking)\r\n\r\nRock, reggae & sing-along covers to carry you into December 🙌\r\nIf you’re around Little Falls on Friday — swing by for a cold one & live music 🍻\r\n\r\nSponsors:\r\n✨ Jaded Ink\r\n💪 WhatTheFit4', '2025-11-28 00:00:00', '20:00:00', 0.00, NULL, 'artists/art_deedewald_4565/events/event_9011_dee_dewald___hogshead_rock_cottage_28_nov_2025-11-26/poster/YX0Vp7wSCND1ZdekZ4Yb73TfeSbF3Cv9teGNbTKg.jpg', '[\"artists\\/art_deedewald_4565\\/events\\/event_8730_dee_dewald___hogshead_rock_cottage_28_nov_2025-11-26\\/gallery\\/E9TaeyEJBCq3baBxGvv5EnzdGHhlLpsEydSyjdSK.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 55, 'artist', 61, '2025-11-26 14:57:09', '2025-11-26 15:00:33'),
