(831, 'Woofstock November Market @ Vitozol Dog Park, Northriding', '🌼🐾 WOOFSTOCK 2025 🐾🌼\r\nHosted by Paws From Heaven\r\n📍 Vitozol Dog Park, Northriding\r\n📅 Saturday, 29 November 2025\r\nPeace. Love. Paws. ✌️💛🐕\r\nGet ready for a tail-wagging good time at Woofstock 2025 – a family + pet-friendly market day filled with music, food, fun, and fur-ever memories!\r\nBring the whole family (yes, fur kids too!) and enjoy a groovy day out surrounded by stalls, good vibes, and wagging tails.\r\n🎶 What to Expect:\r\n🍔 Delicious food & drinks\r\n🦴 Dog treats, toys & apparel\r\n🐾 Animal stalls & adoption awareness\r\n🛍️ Unique goodies for humans too\r\n🎶 Music, laughter & all the Woofstock feels\r\n🎟 Entrance\r\nAdults: R30\r\nKids under 12: R10\r\nFur-children: Free\r\n💛 About the Hosts\r\nWoofstock is proudly hosted by Paws From Heaven, a sanctuary dedicated to saving and caring for 67 special needs cats. Every stall, every purchase, every laugh and wag helps us keep their home safe.\r\n\r\n✨ Save the date, invite your friends, and let’s make this a pawsome day to remember!\r\n👉 RSVP “Going” and share to spread the Woofstock love.', '2025-11-29 00:00:00', '10:00:00', 30.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_7189_woofstock_november_market___vitozol_dog_park__northriding_2025-11-29/poster/miyMGchET9xcVd5QJIrljo9fRSQzmkkz3emq5zV0.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_7189_woofstock_november_market___vitozol_dog_park__northriding_2025-11-29\\/gallery\\/lTjyTpgb9E2c2vKJcQHLEmbgAFYNwKxaT5sD0vYu.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 579, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-27 13:48:19', '2025-11-27 13:48:19'),
