(844, 'That Time of the Year @ AJ\'s Pub 19 Dec', 'Black Friday is over....The real stress is just beginning. 😂\r\n​Is your wallet on recovery? Is the family drama already starting? 😩\r\n​You don\'t need another generic Christmas carol; you need comedy therapy!\r\n​Join SHAYNE MULLER for his new show, \"THAT TIME OF THE YEAR,\" where he breaks down the universal chaos of year-end life: bad gift ideas, forced family fun, and festive fails. Come laugh off the madness!\r\n​🗓️ Date: Friday, 19 DEC 2025\r\n​⏰ Time: 7:00 PM\r\n​📍 Venue: AJ\'s Pub, Roodepoort\r\n​The Best Deal: R50 Online Tickets!\r\n(The price jumps to R80 at the door, so don\'t wait!)', '2025-12-19 00:00:00', '19:00:00', 50.00, NULL, 'users/usa_dave_4014/events/event_8662_that_time_of_the_year___aj_s_pub_19_dec_2025-12-19/poster/xOl3DPUucT4X8gf7j2bkrgHhzvi6z6TxWYLYrGxp.jpg', '[\"users\\/usa_dave_4014\\/events\\/event_8662_that_time_of_the_year___aj_s_pub_19_dec_2025-12-19\\/gallery\\/S2StvAds9M7cp76RxA516YbT1xe0mjdIxa3PAlkV.jpg\"]', 'upcoming', NULL, NULL, 71, 'organiser', 5, '2025-11-28 12:42:05', '2025-11-28 12:42:05'),
