(52, 'The Irish Rock', 'For over two decades, The Irish Rock has been a beloved part of Randburg, Johannesburg – a local favourite where great food, live music, and good company come together. With two vibrant branches, we’ve built a reputation for our warm atmosphere, hearty meals, and the kind of service that keeps guests coming back.\r\n\r\nWhether you\'re in the mood for a legendary burger, a relaxed breakfast, or a platter to share, our menu has something for everyone. Enjoy 10 ice-cold beers on tap, rock \'n roll vibes, and a community spirit that’s kept us going strong for more than 20 years. At The Irish Rock, you’re always welcome – and you’re always among friends.', NULL, 1000, 'the-irish-rock+1759825832@example.local', NULL, NULL, '1212 Opera Rd, Radiokop, Roodepoort, 1709', 'Roodepoort', -26.10488256, 27.92401043, 5, 'App\\Models\\User', 5, 'venues/main_pictures/8wuhtXdOseTlf5jC1LPerXUjkEX6gFEatpsk6CJq.jpg', NULL, '2025-10-07 15:30:32', '2025-10-14 15:42:28'),
