(358, 'Railways Café Cullinan', 'Railways Cafe is more than just a venue -it’s our home! \r\n\r\nAbout Us\r\n\r\nIt’s a space where art lives loud, music matters, and community comes first. Around here, you’re not just passing through – you’re part of the family.\r\n\r\nWe’re proudly South African – diverse, inclusive, a little chaotic, but always welcoming. We back local talent, recycle what we can, support small businesses, and believe live music is still the best kind of magic.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re here for a show, a pizza, or just a cold one you will feel right at home. There’s nothing quite like Railways Cafe.', NULL, 1000, 'info@railways.co.za', NULL, 'https://www.railwayscafe.co.za/index.php/cullinan/', '88 Oak Ave, Cullinan, 0001, South Africa', 'Cullinan', -25.67022070, 28.51570550, 5, 'organiser', 5, 'users/usa_dave_4014/venues/venue_4279_railways_caf___cullinan_2025-10-11/images/4kZ8mONaVMF9b9FQx433CfTHvgOYg9O83f6KU8kV.jpg', NULL, '2025-10-11 18:18:51', '2025-10-11 18:22:25'),
(359, 'The Blue Gate, Mbombela', 'Enjoy the Best of the Good life with us . . .\r\n\r\nThe customer is always right! A mantra that seems to have disappeared in the modern age. The Blue Gate is a unique concept lifestyle center in the heart of Nelspruit. We create amazing experiences for our customers by combining great product and perfect service. Come and enjoy the BEST OF THE GOOD LIFE with us and see just what the Lowveld has been missing . . .', NULL, 2000, 'info@bluegate.co.za', NULL, 'https://bluegate.co.za/', '46 Ehmke St, Mbombela, 1201, South Africa', NULL, -25.47792500, 30.98559920, 5, 'organiser', 5, 'users/usa_dave_4014/venues/venue_9189_the_blue_gate__mbombela_2025-10-11/images/kinBsdLSMeuQnQor2nihitNjIVB0kJwHprOuw5Ca.jpg', NULL, '2025-10-11 18:39:31', '2025-10-11 18:39:31'),
